<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- POGORO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walonguziya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Walonguziya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walonguziya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Walo</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHITABU SHA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALONGUZIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Walonguziya ndo tambiru ya shaka sha isitoliya shashifatiti pa Waisraeli kuikankala na kuyikolamlima isi ya Kanani. Shiweriti ndo shaka sha makontola shashigenderana na vipindi vya madoda na ntabiku na kuyonelwa na shakapanu kukombuluwa. Waisraeli kwa ntambu yawu mewayanji kuguwira wamlungu wa shinyagu, shakapanu Mlungu kagajega maisi gamonga gizi na kuwayonera. Kulawa panu wantu mewalili na kumwuyira Mlungu, na panu Mlungu mekasyaguli walonguziya yawashemitwi “Walonguziya”, su kuwakombola wantu na kuwawusiya muumanda na kuwoneluwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwahera yakaweriti na unakaka wa gaa ndo yakashilembiti shitabu sha Walonguziya. Wantu wa makashu wajimiriti handa Samueli mbuyi gwa Mlungu ndo yakalembiti, kumbiti tuweza kuwera na unakaka nakamu handa shilembitwi mushaka sheni Israeli waweriti kala na mfalumi. Toziya shitabu shilola kumbeli na kulonga galii ga vyaka vya Walonguziya handa shaka shilii Israeli waweriti ndiri na mfalumi (shipandi 17:6; 18:1; 19:1; na 21:25). Handa Waisraeli walawiti kuumanda Misli pakati 1400 K.K (ayi ilanguziya malawiru yagaweriti mushitabu ashi gawera mushinja), 1300 mpaka 1050 K.K shaka Sauli pawamupiti utuwa kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweraamu</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu ashi shankutambira visoweru vya nkondu za upeleru pakati pa Waisraeli na Wakanaani pa kuhowa kwa Yoshua. Viraa vipandi avi vivugula njira ya kumaniziya shaka sha Walonguziya palii Mlungu pakawasyaguliti walonguziya yawalonguziyiti na kuwalopola Israeli kulawa mumakakala ga wankondu wawu. Shipandi 1 mpaka 3:6</para>
  <para style="io">Viraa virii shitabu shitakula visoweru vya Walonguziya gwekagweka yawasyagulitwi na Mlungu kuwatanga Israeli. Shipandi 3:7 mpaka 16:31</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu shitakulira Waisraeli ntambu yawamleti Mlungu Shipandi 17 mpaka 21.</para>
  <para style="io">Upeleru ulanguziya Waisraeli ntambu yawamfiri mfalumi mguwira Mlungu su kawalonguziyi kutenda yagafiruwa kulongolu kwa Mlungu. Kuliku kuwera na walonguziya yawatenditi galii gawawona kuwera gaherepa walaweni.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuwakomanga nkondu Wakanaani yawasigaliti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Pakahowiti kala Yoshuwa, Waisraeli wamkosiyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Hashi, likabila gaa haligendi kutukomangira uti na Wakanaani?” <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawankula, “Likabila lya Yuda haligendi uti kulikomanga nawu, toziya niwatenda wawakanki Wakanaani.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Wantu wa likabila lya Yuda, wawagambiriti walongu wawu wantu wa likabila lya Simiyoni, “Muweri pamuhera na twenga patugenda kuitola kwa makakala isi ilii yatupananuwa. Viraa twenga hatugendi pamuhera na mwenga kuitola isi yamgenda kupananuwa.” Su likabila lya Simiyoni lijimiriti kulikolera pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Su wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wagenditi kulikomanga na Wakanaani, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenda womberi wawakanki Wakanaani pamuhera na Waperizi, wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wawalagiti wantu elufu lilongu munkondu kumji gwa Beziki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Mumji gulii wamwoniti mfalumi Adoni Bezeki, walikomanga nayu na kuwakanka Wakanaani na Waperizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoni Bezeki katugiti, kumbiti wamfatiti na kumkamula, wamlikituliti vyala vikulu vya mawoku na magulu gakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adoni Bezeki kalonga, “Wafalumi malongu saba yaniwalikituliti vyala vikulu vya mawoku na magulu waweriti wankusala vyavisigaliti pasi pashitalawanda shangu. Vinu Mlungu kandipa ntambu yantenditi.” Womberi wamjegiti ku Yerusalemu, ndo kahowiti aku.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wankuyikanka Yerusalemu na mji imonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wagukomangiti mji gwa Yerusalemu na kugutola kwa makakala. Wawalagiti wenikaya kwa magumba na kugulunguziya nakamu kwa motu mji gulii.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Shakapanu, wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wagenditi kulikomanga na Wakanaani yawalikaliti muisi ya vigongu, Negebu na muisi lalanda. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Wawakomiti viraa Wakanaani yawalikaliti kumji gwa Hebroni, mji gulii kwanja gushemuwiti Kiriyati Ariba, wagankankiti makabila ga Sheshayi na Himani na Talimayi.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli kangukonka mji gwa Debiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Yoshuwa 15:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kulawa aku wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wagenditi kugukomanga mji gwa Debiri, mji agu kwanja gushemitwi Kiriyati Seferi. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Karebu kalongiti, “Muntu yoseri yakaweza kugutola kwa makakala mji gwa Kiriyati Seferi, hanumuyugiziyi muhinga gwangu Akisa.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Su Otinieli mwana gwa Kenazi yakaweriti mpusu gwakuyi Karebu, kagutoliti kwa makakala mji gulii, Karebu kamlaviya muhinga gwakuyi Akisa kayuguwi na Otinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa pakasokiti kwa Otinieli, kamgambiriti Otinieli guluwi lilambu kwa tati gwagu. Akisa kaweriti kakwena mupunda na pakasulukiti pasi, tati gwakuyi kamkosiyiti, “Hashi megufiri nikupanani shishi?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Akisa kamwankuliti, “Gumpanani ntekelera! Nduwa gunupi mbwiru za mashi toziya semu yagunupiti aku Negebu iyuma.” Shakapanu Karebu kampananiti mbwiru za mashi za pasi na pampindi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Wiwuka wa Keni ulii yakaweriti mganafu gwa Musa, wakweniti pamuhera na wantu wa likabila lya Yuda kulawa mji gwa Mitendi, gweni ndo Yeriku mpaka kushiwala sha Yuda Munegebu pakwegera na mji gwa Aradi, walikaliti aku pamuhera na wantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Wantu wa likabila lya Yuda pamuhera na walongu wawu wa likabila lya Simioni wawakankiti Wakanaani yawalikaliti Sefati. Wagwagamiziyiti nakamu mji agu na kugalambula litawu lyakuyi kuwera Horima.<verse eid="JDG 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Viraa wantu wa likabila lya Yuda wagutoliti kwa makakala miji ya Gaza pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi, Ashikeloni pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi, na Ekroni pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na wantu wa likabila lya Yuda, na womberi wayitoliti kwa makakala semu ya vigongu. Kumbiti wasinditi kuwakanka wenikaya wa isi lalanda toziya mbutuka zawu zyazikwegwa na farasi munkondu ziweriti za shuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Mji gwa Hebroni gupananwa kwa Karebu kulawirana na malagaliru ga Musa. Karebu kaziwingiti kulawa aku nkolu ntatu za Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Kumbiti wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini wawawingiti ndiri Wayebusi yawalikaliti kumjini Yerusalemu, ndo mana Wayebusi walikala pamuhera na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini kumjini Yerusalemu mpaka leru.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila lya Efurayimu pamuhera na Manasi wankuikanka Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Wantu wa makabila ga Yosefu wagenditi wagukomangiti mji gwa Beteli na Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera nawu. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Kwanja waweriti wawatuma walolalola wagenda kugulolalola mji gwa Beteli. Mji agu mashaka gapititi wagushemiti Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Walolalola awa wamwoniti muntu yumu kalawiti kumjini, wamgambiriti, “Gwee gutulanguziyi ntambua ya gwingira, na twenga hapeni tutendi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Yomberi kawalanguziya njira yaingira mjini. Su wingira na kumlaga kila muntu yakaweriti kumji, kumbiti wamleka muntu ulii pota kumlaga mweni pamuhera na kaya yakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Muntu ulii kahamiriti isi ya Wahiti, aku kanyawiti mji yagushemitwi Luzu, mji agu gushemuwa hangu mpaka leru.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawawingitwi ndiri na Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Wantu wa likabila lya Manasi wawawingiti ndiri wenikaya wa mji gwa Betisheani pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi, Taanaki pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi, Dori pamuhera na vijiji vyaku, Ibileyamu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi na Megidu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi. Wakanaani wendereyiti kulikala muisi ayi. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Ata Waisraeli pawaweriti na likakala wawawingiti ndiri Wakanaani kumbiti wawakakanikiti wawatenderi lihengu.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Wantu wa likabila lya Efurayimu wawawingiti ndiri Wakanaani yawalikaliti aku Gezeri, kumbiti Wakanaani wendereyiti kulikala kulii pakati pawu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Wantu wa likabila lya Zebuloni wawawingiti ndiri wenikaya wa mji gwa Kitironi na walii wa mji gwa Nahalali, su wendereyiti kulikala pamuhera awa Wakanaani pawawatendiziya lihengu kwa kuwakakanika handa wamanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Wantu wa likabila lya Asheri wawawingiti ndiri wenikaya wa mji gwa Ako na Sidoni na Alabu na Akizibu na Heliba na Afeka na Rehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Wantu wa likabila lya Asheri walikaliti pamuhera na Wakanaani wenikaya wa isi ilii toziya wawawingiti ndiri.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Wantu wa Likabila lya Nafutali wawawingiti ndiri wenikaya wa mji gwa Betishe Meshi na Beti Anati, kumbiti walikaliti pakati pa Wakanaani awa. Wawatenda wenikaya wa miji ayi wawatenderi lihengu kwa kuwakakanika.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Waamori wawawingiti wantu wa likabila lya Dani kugenda kuvigongu. Wawajimiriti ndiri waseleri kwiza kulikala isi za lalanda. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Waamori wendereyiti kulikala mumiji yayiweriti kulugongu lwa Heresi na Aiyaloni na Shaalibimu. Kumbiti wantu wa makabila ga Manasi na Efurayimu wawakolitimlima Waamori na kuwatenda watendi lihengu kwa kuwakakanika. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mbaka ya Waamori iweriti kushana mwa Sela, kupitira shinjira Akaribilimu na kwendeleya.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu aku Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kawukiti Giligali, kagenditi Bokimu, kawagambira Waisraeli handa Mlungu kalonga, “Niwalaviyiti muisi ya Misri na kuwajega muisi yanuwalagiliti kwa kuwalipira wambuyi wenu. Ntakuliti kuwera hapeni nilimegi nakamu lipatanu lyangu na mwenga mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Kwa mwenga nuwalagaliriti namtenda lipatanu na wenikaya wa isi ayi na hamuvibomoli vitalawanda vya kutambikira vyawu. Kumbiti mwenga mpikinira ndiri liziwu lyangu. Iwera hashi mtenda hangu? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Vinu niwagambirani hapeni nuwawingi awa toziya ya mwenga, kumbiti hawawagaziyi na wamlungu wawu hawaweri migomiziwu kwa mwenga kwa kuyiguwira.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Payiweriti Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakawagambiriti wantu woseri wa Israeli visoweru avi, wantu wabotangiti na kulira. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Wapashemiti pahala palii Bokimu mana yakuyi kulira. Palii wamlaviliriti tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Pa Yoshuwa kuwagambira kwaheri Waisraeli, kila yumu kagenditi kutola kwa makakala pahala pakuwi pawambaguliriti kuhala. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Waisraeli wamtendiriti Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka goseri za makaliru ga Yoshuwa na pakuhowa kwakuyi, womberi shaka shoseri wendereyiti kutenda gambira wazewi walii yawasigaliti yawawoniti matendu makulu galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakawatendiriti Waisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni na ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kahowiti pakawera na umuli wa vinja miya yimu na lilongu. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Womberi wamsiriti pahala pawambaguliriti paweri pakuwi aku Timina Tiheresi, muisi ya migongu ya Efurayimu kushana kulugongu Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Shakapanu wantu woseri wa shiyiwuku shakuyi wahowiti, shifata shiyiwuku shimonga shilii shimumaniti ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu ama vitwatira virii vyakawatenderiti wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wamlema Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Su Waisraeli watenditi ukondola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, na wanjiti kuwaguwira wamlungu wa Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Wamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wazewi wawu ulii yakawalaviyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri, wanjiti kuwaguwira wamlungu wamonga, wamlungu yawaguwirituwiti na wantu wawalikaliti kumbwega kwawu. Womberi wawasuntamaliti wamlungu awa na kumtenda Mtuwa Mlungu kakalali nentu. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Wamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu, wawatendera wamlungu wa Mabaali na Maashitaroti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Su maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gaweriti makulu kwa Waisraeli, su kawalekiti wapoka watoli lunda zawu. Kawatenditi wankondu yawawazyengetiti wawakomangi, Waisraeli wasinditi nakamu kulikomanga na wankondu yawaweriti pakwegera nawa. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Kila pawagenditi kulikomanga nkondu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenditi wasindi munkondu, ntambu yakawaberiziyiti na kulirapa. Womberi waweriti mukwinginika kukulu.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kawasagula watoza ndo yawawalopoziyiti kulawa kwa wantu yawawapokiti lunda zawu. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Kumbiti wawapikinira ndiri ata watoza wawu, su watenditi uhumba kwa kuwafata wamlungu wamonga na kuwaguwira. Wagalambukiti na kuyileka njira yeni watati wawu wayigenderiti, njira ya kujimira lagaliru za Mtuwa. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Mala zoseri Mtuwa Mlungu pakawajegiriti mtoza, mweni kaweriti pamuhera na mtoza ulii, kawalopoziyiti kulawa kwa wankondu wawu mushaka shoseri sha makaliru ga mtoza ulii. Pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu kawawoniriti lusungu pakapikiniriti kulila kwawu, kulawirana na kutabika na ntambu yawatabisitwi. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Kumbiti kila mala mtoza pakahowiti, wantu wawuyiriti kutenda vintu viherepa ndiri kuliku watati wawu ntambu yawatenditi. Wawafatiti wamlungu wamonga, wawatendera na kuwasundamalira, waleka ndiri kutenda vitwatira vyawabelitwi kutenda. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kawakalalira nentu Waisraeli, pakalonga, “Toziya wantu awa wamega lipatanu lyandenditi na wambuyi wawu, walema kujimira liziwu lyangu, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />Hapeni nigawingi kayi maisi galii Yoshuwa kagasigaliziyiti, shaka pakahowiti. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Hanigajegi maisi aga kuwajera Waisraeli moni kuwera hawayiwuyiri njira yaneni handa wambuyi wawu ama ndala.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kagaleka maisi aga, pota kugawinga kalongola na pota kawapanana ukanka pa Yoshuwa kuhowa!<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Maisi yagasigaliti muisi ayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Aga ndo maisi Mtuwa Mlungu kagalekiti su kawajeri Waisraeli weni waweriti haweni likomi nkondu muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Katenditi hangu su kuwapanana wantu wa viyiwuka avi malifa ga kulikomanga toziya waweriti haweni woni nkondu. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Awa yawasigaliti muisi ndo wakulu wamhanu wa Wafilisti na Wakanaani woseri na Wasidoni na Wahivi yawalikaliti mumigongu ya Lebanoni kulawa lugongu Baali Herimoni mpaka Hamati.<verse eid="JDG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kafiliti kuwatendera awa su kawajeri Waisraeli, kawoni handa hawajimili lagiru zakuwi zakawalagaliriti wazewi wawu kupitira Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Su, Waisraeli walikaliti pamuhera na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamori na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Wayugiti wahinga wawu na kuwayugiziya wahinga kwa wantemba wa maisi aga na kuwaguwira wamlungu wawu.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Waisraeli watenda ukontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu wamulwaluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu gwawu, Waguwira Mabaali na Maashera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Su, maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gakalipa kwa Israeli, na yomberi kawatula mumawoku mwa Kushani Rishataimu mfalumi gwa Haramu Naharaimu na womberi wamtendera kwa shaka sha vinja vinani. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Waisraeli wamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi kawajegera muntu gwa kuwalopola, Otinieli mwana gwa Kenazi, mpusu gwa Karebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Su, rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu imwizira Otinieli, na yomberi kawera mloguziya gwa Waisraeli. Otinieli kagenditi kunkondu na Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana Otiniheri uwezu wa kumkanka Kushani Rishataimu mfalumi gwa Aramu. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Hangu isi iwera na ponga kwa shaka sha vinja malongu msheshi. Shakapanu Otinieli mwana gwa Kenazi, kahowa.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi kawera mlonguziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Waisraeli watenditi kayi ukontola kulongola kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana likakala mfalumi gwa Egiloni gwa Moabu kawakomangi Waisraeli, toziya watenditi ukontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Egiloni kawajojoniriti Waamoni na Waamaleki, kagenda kulikomanga na Waisraeli, kawakanka. Kagutola kwa makakala mji gwa Mitendi gweni ndo Yeriku. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Waisraeli wamtendera mfalumi Egiloni gwa Moabu, kwa shaka sha vinja lilongu na minani.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Kumbiti Waisraeli pawamliriti Mtuwa Mlungu, na yomberi kawajegeriti muntu gwa kuwalopola, Ehudi mwana gwa Gera yakatendera lihengu liwoku lya kumshigi, gwa likabila lya Benjamini. Waisraeli wamtumiti kajegi mafupu gawu kwa Egiloni mfalumi gwa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi kalinyawira ligumba lyana ukola kuwili, utali wakuwi sentimita malongu mhanu. Kalitawa mushunu shakuyi uwega wa kumliwu mngati muguwu yakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Shakapanu kamjegera mfalumi Egiloni gwa Mowabu mafupu galii. Egiloni kaweriti muntu kanenepa nentu. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi pakamaliliti kulaviya mafupu, kawagambira wantu yawajegiti lifupu, wawuyi ukaya. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Kumbiti yomberi pakasokiti kushinyagu sha mabuwi yagasongolitwi pakwegera na Giligali, kamwuyira Egiloni kalonga, “Nana ulagilagi wa gwenga wa bada, mtuwa mfalumi.” Mfalumi kawagambira wantumintumi walikali jii na womberi walawa kunja. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Na Ehudi kapasegeleriti pakalikaliti palii mshumba shakuyi shana mpepu, kamgambira “Nana ulagilagi kwa gwenga kulawa kwa Mlungu.” Mfalumi kagoloka pashiti pakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi kalisomola ligumba lyakuyi kwa liwoku lyakuyi lya kumshigi kulawa muliwondu lyakuyi lya kumliwu, kamsoma kumtima gwakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Limagi lingira mngati pamuhera na mhanya gwakuyi, lipaki liligipikira limagi ali toziya Ehudi kalisomola ndiri limagi lilii kayi, liwera lilawira kwa kumbeli. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Shakapanu, Ehudi kalawa kunja kumdamu pakayitatiti kala migomi ya shumba ashi kwa Ufunguu.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />“Ehudi pakawukiti, wantumintumi wa mfalumi wawuya. Pawawoniti migomi goseri ga shumba wagatata, waliholiti kagenda kushowu sha mngati mwa numba.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Wahepera mpaka wanja kuwera na shashatika. Pawawoniti kavugula ndiri, watola ufunguu na kuvugula migomi. Wamwona mfalumi gwawu kagonja pasi, kahowa kala.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Pawaweriti wanguhepa, Ehudi katoloka kapitira kuvinyagu vya mabuwi, kagenda Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Pakasokiti aku muisi ya migongu ya Efraimu kagomba lipenga, na Waisraeli wasuluka pamuhera na yomberi kulawa kumigongu aku na yomberi kawalongolera. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Kawagambira, “Mnfati, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawalekera wankondu wenu Wamoabu mumawoku mwenu.” Wamfata mpaka shiloku sha Yoridani na kushitola kwa makakala shiloku shashigendera Mowabu, wadiwa muntu yoseri nakapita. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Lishaka ali, wawalaga Wamowabu elufu lilongu, wantu woseri wana afya na makakala, kwahera ata yumu yakatolokiti. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Lishaka ali Waisraeli wawakanka Wamoabu. Isi iwera na ponga kwa shaka sha vinja semanini.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgari kawera mlonguziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Pa Ehudi Shamgari mwana wa Anati, kaweriti katola lupenu lwakuyi. Kawalagiti Wafilisti miya sita kwa luhonga lwa kulolelera wang'ombi. Na yomberi viraa kawalopoziyiti Waisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debora na Baraki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Pakahowiti kala Ehudi, Waisraeli watenditi kayi ukontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatula mumawoku mwa Yabini, mfalumi gwa Kanaani, mweni kalikaliti aku Hazori na Mkulu gwa shonta lyakuyi kaweriti Sisera, mweni kalikaliti aku Harosheti Hagoimu <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Mfalumi Yabini kaweriti na mbutuka za nkondu miya tisa za shuma za kukweguwa na Farasi. Hangu kawayoniriti nentu Waisraeli kwa mivinja malongu mawili, na womberi wamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu kawatangi.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Shaka ashi, kuweriti na mbuyi gwa Mlungu mdala yawamshemiti Debora, mdala gwa Lapidoti, yakaweriti mtoza gwa Waisraeli shaka ashi. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debora kaweriti katendera lihengu lyakuyi pasi pa mtendi yaguweriti pakati pa lushi lwa Rama na lushi lwa Beteli muisi ya migongu ya Efureimu. Wantu wa Israeli wamwiziliti su kawatozeri masitaka gawu.<verse eid="JDG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Lishaka limu kamshemiti Baraki mwana gwa Abinoamu gwa Kadeshi muisi ya Nafutali. Pakiziti kamgambiriti, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kakulagalira hangu, gugendi gujojoniri wantu waku kulugongu Tabori, gusyaguli wantu elufu lilongu kulawa makabila ga Nafutali na Zebuloni. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Neni hanimtendi Sisera, mkulu gwa shonta lya Yabini, kizi na mashonta na mbutuka zakuyi kulikomanga na gwenga mulushemba Kishoni, na hanikupanani uwezo wa kumkanka.” <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Baraki kamgambira Debora, “Handa pagugenda pamuhera na neni, hang'endi. Kumbiti pagugenda ndiri pamuhera na neni, hapange'ndi.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debora kamwankula, “Aya, hang'endi pamuhera na gwenga, kumbiti guvimani hangu hapagupati ligoya lyoseri lya ukanka wa nkondu ayi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu, hakamtuli Sisera mumawoku mwa mdala.” Su Debora wagenda pamuhera na Baraki aku Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Baraki kagashema makabila ga Nafutali na Zebuloni aku Kedeshi, wantu elufu kumi wamfata. Debora kagenda pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Shaka ashi, Heberi yakaweti Mkeni, kalitula gweka na Wakeni wayaguwi weni ndo wiwuka wa Hobabu yakaweriti shemeji gwa Musa. Mweni kanyawa liringu lyakuyi kutali aku kumwaloni gwa Zananimu, pakwegera na Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Sisera pakapatiti visoweru kwa wantu handa Baraki mwana gwa Abinoamu kagenda kulugongu Tabori, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />kajojoniriti mashonta wakuyi woseri na mbutuka zakuyi miya tisa za shuma zazikweguwa na farasi, kawuka Harosheti Hagoimu, kagenda kulushemba Kishoni. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debora kamgambira Baraki, “Gugendi! Leru pashiru mweni Mtuwa Mlungu kakupanana uwezu wa kumkanka Sisera. Mtuwa Mlungu kakulongolera.” Su, Baraki kasuluka kulawa kulugongu Tabori pakawalonguziya wantu wakuyi elufu kumi. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Baraka katenda makomangu, na Mtuwa Mlungu kamzigiziya Sisera na wamashonta wakuyi woseri. Sisera kasuluka mumbutuka yakuyi katuga kwa magulu. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Baraki kawafata wamashonta awa na mbutuka mpaka Harosheti Hagoimu na kuwalaga wamashonta woseri wa Sisera kwa magumba, kasigaliti ndiri ata muntu yumu.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Kumbiti Sisera katuga kwa magulu mpaka mliringu mwa Yaeli, mdala gwa Heberi yakaweriti Mkeni. Katenditi hangu toziya kuweriti na lipatanu lya ponga pakati pa mfalumi Yabini gwa Hazori na kaya ya Heberi. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli kalawa kumwanka Sisera, kamgambira, “Mtuwa gwangu, kalibu kwa neni, pota nagutira.” Kingira mliringu lyakuyi, kamgibikira kwa libulangeti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisera kamgambira Yaeli, “Shondi, gunupi mashi shididini nandi, toziya nyumiluwa.” Kampanana maweri pa mashi shombu sha likuli, shakapanu kamgibikira kayi.<verse eid="JDG 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisera kamgambira, “Gugoloki pamlyangu gwa liringu. Muntu yoseri pakiza kukukosiya handa kwana muntu yoseri panu, gumgambiri kwahera.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Sisera kaweriti katoka nentu su kagonja mpota, shakapanu Yaeli mdala gwa Heberi, katola nyundu na shigingi sha kugolusilira liringu, kamgendera mpolimpoli kashikomelera shigingi sha liringu pasheni pakuyi shipena mpaka palitapaka, toziya kaweriti kagonja nentu mpota kwa kutoka. Su, Sisera kahowa palapalii.<verse eid="JDG 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Na Baraki pakaweriti kankumfata Sisera, Yaeli kalawa kunja kumwanka kamgambira, “Gwizi na neni hanukulanguziya ulii yagumfata.” Baraki kingira mnumba mwa liringu lya Yaeli na kumwona Sisera pasi, kahowa na shigingi sha liringu pashiwunji shakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Hangu, lishaka ali Mlungu kawapanana Waisraeli ukanka kwa mfalumi Yabani gwa Kanani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Waisraeli wendereyiti kumgendera na kumkomanga komanga mfalumi Yabini gwa Kanani, mpaka pawamlagiti.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa Debora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Lishaka ali, Debora na Baraki mwana gwa Abinoamu wimba lwimbu alu.<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Wakulu walawiriti kulonguziya Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">wantu walilaviyiti weni. Mumugambiri mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Mpikiniri, Mwenga wafalumi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Mtegi makutu, mwenga wakulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Hanumwimbiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, pagulawiti aku Seiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">pagusulukiti lugongu Edomu, isi ilendemeriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">mpindi zitulusiyiti mashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">yina, mawundi gatulusiya mvula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Migongu itikinyikiti kulongolu kwaku Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">yina, lugongu Sinai kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mumashaka ga Shamgari, mwana gwa Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mushaka sha Yaeli, miyanja iyoyiti kupita muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">wanamwanja wapitiriti mvijirajira.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Walimi waweriti kwahera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">wayoyiti kuwera mu Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mpaka pandawiriti neni Dedora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">neni yaweriti handa mawu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Walisyaguliliti wamlungu wasyai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">kuweriti na ngondu muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Kumbiti kuweriti ndiri yakaniti mgoha ama ngawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">pakati pa wantu elufu arubaini ga Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Niwapanani ligoya wakulu wa mashonta ga Israeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">yawalilaviyiti kwa kufira weni pakati pa wantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mumugambiri mayagashii Mtuwa Mlungu! <verse eid="JDG 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Mbweri, mwenga yamkwena punda wafufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mwenga yamlikala mumayalika gakulivagira wankanyama ga beyi nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mwenga yamtyanga munjira, mbweri shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="JDG 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Mpikaniri umatu wa shipinga sha wantu sha kumanegu ga mashi pawawagambira ukanka wa Mtuwa Mlungu, ukanka wa wantu wa Israeli! Shakapanu wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu pawaseleriti kulawa mumiji yawu. <verse eid="JDG 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Gwimuki, gwinuki, Debora!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Gwimuki, gwimuki gwimbi lwimbu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Gwimuki, Baraki mwana gwa Abinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">guwatoli lopola waku. <verse eid="JDG 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Makambaku yawasigaliti waseleriti, wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu wagenditi kumkomanira kwa wana makakala. <verse eid="JDG 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Kulawa Efraimu waseleriti kululalanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">wawafata walongu wawu wantu wa benjamini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kulawa Makiri waseleriti wakulu wa mashonta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kulawa Zebuluni walongoziya wakulu. <verse eid="JDG 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Wakulu wa Isakari wagenda pamuhera na Debora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">yina na wantu wa Isakari wiza kwa Baraki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wamfata kalongola mpaka kululalanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Kumbiti muwamu mwa nkolu za Rubeni kuweriti mbagulanu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wasinditi kwamuwa. <verse eid="JDG 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Ntamba gaa msigali kumbeli na kondolu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Su kupikinira liziwu lya mlolera pakashema?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Muwamu mwa nkolu za Rubeni kuweriti na mabagulanu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">wasinditi kwamuwa. <verse eid="JDG 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Gileadi kalikaliti kumwambu Kuyoridani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Na likabira lya Dani ntambu gaa walikaliti mumeri mashaka gavuwa? Likabira lya Asheri lilikaliti jii mmpeku mwa bahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">pahala peni meri pazigolokera. <verse eid="JDG 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Wantu wa Zebuluni ndo wantu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">yawaweriti muatari mwa kuhowiziya makaliru gawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Ata Nafutali waweriti mukuhowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Muluwaga lwa nkondu. <verse eid="JDG 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Aku Taanaki, kumbeku ya kumbwiru za Megidu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">wafalumi wiziti walikomanga, wafalumi wa Kanani walikomangiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">kumbiti wapatiti ndiri lopola za madini ga feza. <verse eid="JDG 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ntondu aku kumpindi zilikomiti nkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">zifatiti njira zawu, zilikomangiti na Sisera. <verse eid="JDG 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Lilawa lya lushemba Kishoni gawatoliti kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">yina lilawa livuwa lya lushemba Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Gugendi kulongolu kwa likakala, gwee rohu yaneni! <verse eid="JDG 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Farasi wakintiti pawawerit wankupita pawakwalakwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">kwa kwatu zawu. <verse eid="JDG 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">Gugulapili mji gwa Merusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">muwalapili vikalipa wenikaya wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">toziya wiza ndiri kuwatanga wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu kulikomanga na wana likakala. <verse eid="JDG 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yaeli, mdala gwa Heberi yakaweriti gwa lukolu lwa Mkeni. Katekelerwi kuliku wadala woseri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Yina, katekelerwi kuliku wadala woseri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">yawalikala mumalingu. <verse eid="JDG 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisera kamluwiti mashi, na yomberi kampanana maweri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">kamjegeriti siyagi mubakuli ya ligoya. <verse eid="JDG 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kwa liwoku limu kakoliti shigingi sha liringu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">na kwa liwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu nyundu ya fundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kamkoma Sisera kwa nyundu, kambwajula mtuyi gwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">yina, kamkomiti kamposhola shiwunji shakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisera kang'ong'onaliti kaguwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">kagonjiti jii pamagulu gaguyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Panu pakang'ong'onaliti ndo kaguwiti kahowa! <verse eid="JDG 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Mawu gwakuyi Sisera kaloliti kulawa kulidilisha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">kalalamika pakalonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Kwa ntambu gaa mbutuka za kukweguwa na Farasi zakuyi zikawira?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Mbona mtukuliru gwa mbutuka zyakuwi zikawira kupikinilika? <verse eid="JDG 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Wadala wana luhala wamwankula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">Yina, kalinyamaziya kayi na kayi kwa lyankulu ali. <verse eid="JDG 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />Pota kulishera wangusakula na kugawana vyawalopuliti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">mhinga yumu ama wawili kwa kila shonta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">nguwu ya sufu ya rangi kwajili ya Sisera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Nguwu ya sufu yawataliziwiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">na mitandiru miwili ya kung'aliziya kwajili ya singu yangu! <verse eid="JDG 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, walaguwi wankondu waku woseri!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Kumbiti yawakufira wang'ering'eti handa mshenji gwagulawa!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Na isi iwera na ponga kwa shaka sha mivinja alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Waisraeli watenditi ukontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, na Mlungu kawatula mumawoku ga Wamidiyani kwa shaka sha vinja saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Wamidiyani wawayoniriti nentu Waisraeli, mpaka walibawira malindi na mpanga mumigongu kuwera ngomi zawu.<verse eid="JDG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Kila shaka Waisraeli pawayaliti mbeyu mumalambu, Wamidiyani na Waamaleki na wantu wamonga wa aku kwagulawira mshenji wiziti wawakomanga. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Maisi aga ganyawiti malingu muisi, gawakomanga na kuhalibisiya viboga vyawu vyoseri muisi mpaka mumpaka za Gaza, wawalekera ndiri shoseri Muisraeli, kaweri kondolu, ng'ombi ama punda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Wiziti na malingu gawu na mifugu yawu handa wanjombi, pamuhera na ngamia wawu na kutenda makawu gawu muisi Israeli, wahalibisiyiti isi ya Israeli toziya womberi na wangamia wawu waweriti wavuwa nentu pota kuwalangika. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Waisraeli wawusiyitwi makakala nakamu na Wamidiyani mpaka Waisraeli wamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu kawatangi.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Waisraeli pawamliliti Mtuwa Mlungu kawawusiliri ntabika yawapatiti kulawa kwa Wamidiyani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegera mbuyi, na yomberi kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli kalonga hangu, niwalaviyiti muisi ya Misri kweni muweriti wamanda. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Niwalopuziya mumawoku mwa Wamisri woseri yawawatabisiyiti. Nuwawinga wantu kulongolu kwenu pamuweriti pamwiza na kuwapanana mwenga isi yawu. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Niwagambiziya handa neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu na handa namuwaguwira wamlungu wa Waamori, ambawu mulikala mu isi yawu, kumbiti mulipikinira ndiri liziwu lya neni.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kagenda, kalivaga pasi pa mtera gwa mwaloni gwa Yoashi muntu gwa lukolu lwa Mwaabiezeri, aku Ofura. Gidiyoni mwana gwa Yoashi, kaweriti kankupeta ngano mngati mwa likamiru lya kukamira zabibu su Wamidiyani nawamwona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawira, kamgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na gwenga, gwee shikambaku.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidiyoni kamgambira, “Gwee Mtuwa gwangu, payiwera Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na twenga, mbona vitwatira vyoseri avi vitupata? Vyakoshi vitwatira vyaku vya kulikangashira vyeni wazewi wetu watutambiriti, pawalonga. Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakatulaviyiti muisi ya Misri. Kumbiti vinu Mtuwa Mlungu katwasa na kututula muukola mlima mwa Wamidiyani!”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgalambukira, kamgambira, “gugendi kwa likakala lyaguwera nalu, gukayilopuziyi Israeli kulawa kwa Wamidiyani. Ndo neni yanikulagalira.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gideoni kamwankula, “Shondi Mtuwa, Hawezi hashi kuyilopuziya Israeli? Lukolu lwangu ndo wahushu nakamu mulikbila lya Manasi na namweni neni ndo muntu gwa pasi muwalongu wetu!”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Hanikupanani uwezu na gwenga haguwalagi Wamidiyani handa virii gulaga muntu yumu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidiyoni kamgambira, “Handa pagunjimira pamasu paku, gunanguziyi lilanguliru su nivimani handa ndo gwenga nakaka yaguyowira na neni. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Nikuluwa naguwuka panu mpaka pambuya na kukujegera lifupu lyangu na kulitula kulongolu kwaku.” Na yomberi kankula, “Hanilivagi panu mpaka paguwuya.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidiyoni kagenda ukaya kwakuyi, katanda mwana gwa mbuzi na libumunda lwalilekeluwa ndiri simika katendera kilu lilongu lya ubumu, kalekera shinofu mkati mushikapu na mshwiku mushiwiga, shakapanu kamjegera pasi pa mtera gwa mwaloni, kampanana.<verse eid="JDG 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Ntumintumi gwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gutoli shinofu na libumunda guvituli pampindi palitalawu ali. Shakapanu gulekeri mshwiku pampindi pa libumunda na shinofu.” Na yomberi katenda hangu. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu katalipisiya luhonga lwaluweriti mliwoku lyakuyi, kashinkula shinofu na libumunda kwa upeleru wa luhonga. Vumu, motu gulawa kulitalawu, gulunguziya vinofu na mabumunda. Katepu ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kawuka kulongolu kwakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gidiyoni ndo kavimana handa ayu kaweriti ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kalonga, “shondi neni, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya niliwona na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi sheni kwa sheni.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Ponga iweri na gwenga! Nagutira, hapeni guhowi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidiyoni kamnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda sha kutambikira aku na kupashema, “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakajega ponga.” Pakutambikira palii pa aku Ofura, lushi lwa Wabiezeri.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Pashiru palii, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Gidiyoni, “Gutoli ng'ombi shipalu mdidini yumu gwa tati gwaku, ng'ombi shipalu mdididni gwa pili gwa vinja saba. Gubomoli pakutambikira pa Baali pakawera napa tati gwaku na kumeganga shinyagu sha Ashera shashiwera pakwegera nashi. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Shakapanu, gunyawili neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, shitalawanda sha kutambikira ntambu yaifiruwa pampindi pashidunda ashi. Shakapanu gundaviliri tambiku ya kulunguziya ya ng'ombi ulii pagutendera mpanda za shinyagu shilii sha Ashera shagushimegangiti.”<verse eid="JDG 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Su, Gidiyoni kawatola wantumintumi wakuyi lilongu, katenditi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. Kumbiti toziya katiriti walongu wakuyi na wantu wa kumjini, katenditi ndiri paliwala, katenditi shaka sha pashiru.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Weni kaya wa mji pawimkiti mandawira putiputi wawoniti shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Baali na shinyagu sha Asheri shashiweriti pakwegera nashi wavihalibisiya. Ng'ombi shipalu mdidini uli kaweriti kalunguziwa pampindi pa kutambikira papaweriti wapanyawiwa pahala panu. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Walikosiya, “Gaa katenda shitwatira ashi?” Pawalolitiloliti wayambula handa Gidiyoni mwana gwa Yoashi ndo yakaweriti katenditi hangu. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Wenikaya wa mji wamwizira Yoashi, wamgambira, “Gumlaviyi mwana gwaku tumlagi, toziya kahalibisiya shitalanda sha kutambikira sha Baali na kayimeganga shinyagu ya Ashera yayiweriti pakwegera nashi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Yoashi kawagambira woseri walii yawamgenderiti, “hashi, mwankumtakulira Baali? Hashi, hammulopuziyi? Yoseri yakamtakulira hakalagwi pamberi pa kushiya. Handa Baali ndo Mlungu nakaka, su, kalitakuliri mweni toziya shitalawanda sha kutambikira shakuyi shihalibisiwa.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Lishaka ali wamshema Gidiyoni “Yeru Baali” mana yakuyi, “Baali na kalitakuliri palongolu pakuyi.” Toziya kabomola shitawanda sha kutambikira sha Baali.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Wamidiyani na Waamaleki na wantu woseri wa kwagulawa mshenji wajojonika wagenda na kunyawa malingu gawu mululalanda lwa Yezireeli.<verse eid="JDG 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Shakapanu Rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu imlonguziya Gidiyoni. Gidiyoni kagomba lipenga kuwashema Wabiezeli wizi wamfati. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Kawatuma walagilagi muisi yoseri ya Manasi wizi wamfati. Walagilagi wamonga kawatuma kuwashema wantu wa makabila ga Asheri, Zebuluni na Nafutali, na womberi wiza wawera pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidiyoni kamgambira Mlungu, “Payiwera haguyilopuziyi Israeli kwa kupitira neni ntambu yagutakuliti, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />vinu nankuntula likuli lya kondolu na mibahira pahala panu pakupepetera nganu. Payiwera hakuweri na mangami pampindi pa likuli hera na pasi yayizyengeta payiwera iyuma, su, hanivimani handa hagulopuziyi Waisraeli kwa kupitira neni ntambu yagulongiti.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Su iwera hangu, toziya pakimkiti mandawira shirawu yakuyi, kakamiti mangami yagaweriti mulikuli, kamemeziya bakuli. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidiyoni kamgambira Mlungu, “Shondi nagunkalalira. Nduwa ntakuli mala yimu hera. Nikuluwa gunjimili ntenderi likuli lilii kutenda lijeru limonga. Nikuluwa pampindi pa likuli lyana mibahira paweri payuma, kumbiti pasi kuweri na mangami.”<verse eid="JDG 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Mlungu katenda hangu pashiru palii, toziya, likuli liweriti liyuma na kumbiti kuweriti na mangami pasi poseri kuzyengeta likuli lilii.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidiyoni kankuwakanka Wamidiyani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Lishaka limu Yeru Baali yani Gidiyoni na wantu woseri wayaweriti pamuhera na yomberi wimukiti putiputi, wanyawiti malingu gawu kululalanda pakwegera na mbwiru ya mashi ya Harodi, malingu ga Wamidiyani gaweriti kushana mwa lulalanda pakwegera na lugongu Mori.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Gidiyoni, “wantu waguwera nawa wavuwa nentu kwa neni kutenda guwakanki Wamidiyani. Waisraeli nawiza kulizyuma handa womberi wawakanka Wamidiyani kumbiti neni ndiri. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Vinu guwabweleri wantu woseri handa muntu yoseri yakawera na lyoga ama yakalendemera kasuluki kulugongu Gileadi kawuyi ukaya kwakuyi.” Su, Gidiyoni kawajeriti na wantu ishilini na mbili elufu wawuya ukaya kasigala na wantu ishilini elufu.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Gideoni, “Wantu awa wankali wavuwa nentu. Vinu guwajegi kumbwiru za mashi, na neni hanuwasyaguli aku. Muntu yoseri yanfira kukugambira, ayu hakagendi na gwenga, kagendi na gwenga. Kumbiti Muntu yoseri yanfira kukugambira hapeni kagendi na gwenga, ayu nakagenda na gwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Su, Gidiyoni kawajega wantu kumbwiru za mashi na Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Wantu yawalambita mashi kwa lulimi handa ng'ang'a, haguwatuli gweka na walii yanawasuntamali kulanda mashi kwa mawoku.”<verse eid="JDG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Wantu miya tatu walanditi mashi kwa mawoku gawu. Kumbiti wamonga woseri yawasigaliti wasuntamaliti kulanda mashi.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Gidiyoni, “kwa wantu awa miya tatu yawalanditi kwa kulambita handa wang'ang'a, haniwatendi wawakanki Wamidiyani. Kumbiti wamonga woseri walii wawuyi ukaya kwawu.”<verse eid="JDG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Su, Gidioni katola viboga na lipenga vya walii yawaweriti wankuwuka, kawagambira wagendi ukaya kwawu. Yomberi kasigala na Wantu walii miya tatu. Na liringu lya Wamidiyani liweriti kululalanda uwega wawu wa pasi.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Pashiru palii, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Gidiyoni, “Gugendi gukawakomangi mumalingu mwawu, toziya nikutenda guwakanki. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Kumbiti handa gutira, gugendi pamuhera na ntumintumi gwaku Pura. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Aku hagupikiniri vyawatakula na gwenga hagupati likakala lya kuweza kugenda kuwakomanga.” Su, Gidiyoni kagenda mumpeku mwa malingu ga wankondu pamuhera na ntumintumi gwakuyi Pura mpaka kushituu vya walolera zamu wa kambi ya Wamidiyani.<verse eid="JDG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Wamidiyani na Waameleki na wantu woseri wa kwagulawa mshenji wagonjiti kululalanda, wavuwa handa wanjombi na ngamiya wawu yawawalangika ndiri, wavuwa handa mhanga gwa kumpwani.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidiyoni pakasokiti, kampikanira muntu yumu pakamtambira myaguwi kulota kwakuwi hangu, “Ndotiti niliwoniti libumunda lya shayiri palibiringika mpaka kuliringu lya Wamidiyani, lilikoma Liringu na kugalambula pasi kumpindi. Liringu liguwa pasi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Myaguyi kamwankula, “Ayi imaanisha handa ayu yumonga ndiri ila ndo Gidiyoni mwana gwa Yoashi mweni Mlungu kampanana uwezu wa kutukanka Wamidiyani pamuhera na shonta letu loseri.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Katepu hera Gidiyoni pakapikiniriti ntambiru ayi ya kulota aku na ntakulira yakuyi, kasuntama makukama. Kawawuyira waisraeli mumalingu mwawu kawagambira “Mwimuki tugendeni, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu katupanana uwezu wa kulikanka shonta lya Wamidiyani.”<verse eid="JDG 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Su, kawabagula Wantu walii miya tatu muvipinga vitatu, kawapanana lipenga na viwiga vyana mambamba. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Kawagambira, “Mndoli shanantendi pansegelera muukingu wa malingu na mwenga mtendi shiraa ashi. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Pang'omba lipenga, neni pamuhera na shipinga shangu, mwawoseri mgombi lipenga kulawa kila uwega lilingu na kubota kwa liziwu likulu, pamtakula toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu na toziya ya Gidiyoni!”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Payiweriti pakwegera na ligonugonu, Gidiyoni na shipinga shakuyi sha Wantu miya yimu katepu hera pawasokiti muukingu wa liringu, mwanjiru gwa zamu ya pakati, pashiru walolera pawaweriti wagalambulaniti zamu. Wagomba lipenka na kumeganga viwiga vyawaweriti navi. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Vipinga vyoseri vitatu kwa pamuhera gagomba lipenka na kumeganga maguduliya gawu. Mumawoku gawu ga kumshigi wakoliti mambamba na kwa mawoku gawu ga kimliwu mapenka na kuzigomba, na pawatakula kwa liziwu likulu, “Ligumba toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu na toziya ya Gidiyoni!”<verse eid="JDG 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Wagoloka kila yumu pahala pakuyi kulizyengeta liringu. Shonta loseri lya wankondu lipalangika agawu palishowangana na kutuga.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Wantu wa Gidiyoni wagombiti mapenka gawu miya tatu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenditi Wamidiyani wanji kulikoma weni kwa weni mumalingu. Yawasigaliti watoloka mpaka Beti Shita, kugendera Serera kumbaka ya Abeli Mehola pakwegera na Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Waisraeli wa likabila lya Nafutali na Asheri na Manasi, woseri wawashemiti, wawafatiti Wamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidiyoni katuma walagilagi koseri kuisi ya migongu ya Efureimu wabweri, “Muwaseleleri Wamidiyani na kuwadiwira kwa kulopola nshemba na lushemba Yoridani mpaka Beti Bara.” Su, wapalu woseri wa Efuremu wiza na kululopola lushemba Yoridani mpaka Beti Bara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Watola lopola wakulu wawili wa Midiani, yani Orebu na Zeebu. Wamlaga Orebu mulitalawu lya Orebu, na yomberi Zeebu wamlagira mulikamiru lya Zeebu pawawera wankuwafata Wamidiyani. Wamjegera Godioni mituyi ya Orebu na Zeebu, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Zeba na Zalimuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Wantu wa likabila lya Efureimu wamkosiya Gidiyoni, “Kwa ntambu gaa kututendera hangu? Kwa ntambu gaa gutushema ndiri pagugenditi kulikomanga na Wamidiyani?” Walirewa nayu.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Kumbiti Gidiyoni kawankula, “ntenda shididini pagulifaniziya na ntambu yagutenditi gwenga, lukolu lwangu ludidini hera wa wiwuka wa Abiazeli hera ndo yauwanjiti kulikomanga nkondu, kumbiti shipinga shaku shikulu sha wiwuka wa Efureimu shindangiti neni kumalira lihengu lya makomangu weri, ndo handa zabibu za upeleru zyaziweriti ziherepa nentu kuliku zabibu yazapitwi pakwanjira. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Mlungu kawatenda muwakanka wakulu wa Midiyani na Orebu na Zibu. Hashi, neni ntenda shishi kulifaniziya na mwenga?” Gidiyoni pakatakuliti kala aga, maya gawu kwa yomberi ganyamalira.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gidiyoni na wayaguwi miya tatu wasoka Yoridani, waloka. Tembera waweriti watoka nentu, wendereyiti kuwafata wankondu wawu.<verse eid="JDG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Su, kawagambira wantu wa Sukoti, “Shondi muwapanani wayangu awa mabumunda mana watoka nentu, neni nendereya kuwafata wafalumi Zeba na Salimuna gwa Midiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Kumbiti walongoziya wa Sukoti wamkosiya, “Hashi tuwapanani mabumunda na mwenga mwankali kumkanka Zeba na Salimuna?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidiyoni kawagambira, “Yina, kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu pakatutenda tuwakanki Zeba na Salimuna, hanizidegidegi nshimba zyenu kwa misomi na mbigili za kushiwala.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Kulawa aku kawagendera wantu wa Penueli, kawaluwa ntambu irailii. Na wantu wa Penueli wamwankula ntambu yawawankuliti wantu wa Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gidiyoni kawagambira, “Pambuya weri hanugubomoli mnara agu.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna waweriti aku Karikori, pamuhera na shonta lyawu lya wantu kumi na tano weni ndo yawasigaliti kulawa kulishonta lya wantu kwagulawa mshenji, toziya wayawu miya na ishilini elufu walagitwi. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidiyoni kafata njira ya washuhuzi kwaguzyeta mshenji yayiwera kwagulawa mshenji mwa Nobu na Yogibeha, kalikomanga shonta ali lyaliweriti kala ndiri. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Wafalumi wa Midiyani, Zeba na Salimuna watoloka watuga, kumbiti Gidiyoni kawafatiti, kawabata wafalumi awa na kulipanana shonta lyoseri lyoga likulu.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Shakapanu, Gidiyoni, mwana gwa Yoashi, kawuya kulawa kunkondu kapitira shijirajira sha Heresi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Kamkamula mntemba yumu gwa Sukoti na kumkosiya. Mntemba ayu kamlembera matawu ga wakulu na wazewi wamanika wa Sukoti, walanga yawu wantu woseri sabini na saba.<verse eid="JDG 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidiyoni kawuya kwa wantu wa Sukoti, kawagambira, “Ndo mlihola ntambu yamnigiriti pamtakuliti, iwera hashi tuwapanani mabumunda wantu yawatokiti nentu na mwenga mwankali mwanamkanka Zeba na Zalimuni? Aya su, Zeba na Zalumini ndo awa.” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Su, kawatola wazewi wa Sukoti na kuwazibu wapalu woseri lushi alu kwa kuzideganga nshimba zawu kwa misontu na mbigili. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Viraa virii kagubomoliti mnala gwa Penueli na kuwalaga wenikaya wa lushi alu.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Shakapanu, kawakosiya Zeba na Zalimuna, “Wantu walii yamuwalagiti aku Tabori waweriti hashi?” Wamwankula, “Walifana na gwenga, toziya wawonikaniti handa wana wa mfalumi.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Na yomberi kawagambira, “Awa waweriti walongu wa neni, wana wa mawu yumu. Nilirapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, handa memuwalagi ndiri, ata neni menuwalagi ndiri mwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Shakapanu kamgambira Yeteri, mwiwuka gwakuyi gwa kwanja, “Gugoloki, guwalagi.” Kumbiti Yeteri kaniti lyoga kutola shimagi shikulu shakuyi toziya kaweriti kankali mntemba.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Panu Zeba na Zalumuna walonga, “Gutulagi gamweni gwenga, toziya ali ndo lihengu lya muntu mkulu.” Gidiyoni kagoloka kawalaga mweni Zeba na Zalumuna na kutola mapambu gawu yagaweriti msingu mwa ngamiya wawu.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Shakapanu, Waisraeli wamgambira Gidiyoni, “Gwenga na guweri mkolamlima gwetu, na pa gwenga hawakolimlima walera waku, toziya gwenga gutulopuziya kulawa kwa Wamidiyani.” <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidiyoni kawankula, “Neni hapeni weri mkolamlima gwenu ata mwana gwangu hapeni kaweri mkolamlima gwenu. Mtuwa Mlungu ndo hakaweri mkolamlima gwenu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Shakapanu kawagambira, “Menfiri kuwaluwa kila yumu, kanupi vintu vya zahabu vya kuvala mumakutu vyamlopuliti kwa wankondu.” Walii Wamidiyani waweriti Waishimaeli, yawavaliti vipuli vya zahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Wantu wamwankula, “Hatukupanani kwa kufira twaweni.” Wayalika nguwu na kila yumu kasira amu vipuli vyaviweriti walopola, <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Utopa wa vipuli vyoseri vya zahabu vyakafiriti wampanani viweriti kilu ishilini. Nentu ga aga, kankiti viraa hereni, nguwu za langi ya ulijuwani yazivaliwituwi na wafalumi wa Midiani na mikufu yayiweriti kusingu za ngamiya wawu.<verse eid="JDG 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidiyoni kazitumiya kunyawira shinyagu shakashituliti kumji gwakuyi gwa Ofura. Waisraeli woseri wamleka Mlungu na kugenda aku kushiguwira. Shinyagu ashi shiweriti mgomiziwu kwa Gidiyoni na kaya wakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Su, Wamidiyani wasinditi nakamu na wawera ndiri tiliziya kwa Israeli, na isi ya Israeli iwera na ponga kwa shaka sha vinja alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gidiyoni, yani Yeru Baali, mwana gwa Yoashi kawuya ukaya kwakuwi na kulikala aku.<verse eid="JDG 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidiyoni kaweriti na wana wapalu malongu saba, toziya kayugiti wadala wavuwa. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Kaweriti na mdala kunja aku Shekemu mweni kamleleriti mwana mpalu, litawu lyakuyi Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidiyoni, mwana gwa Yoashi, kahowa pakawera na vinja vivuwa, wamsira mulipumba lya Yoashi, tati gwakuyi, kumji gwa Ofura gwa Wabiezeri.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Pakahowiti kala Gidiyoni, Waisraeli wawuyira wamlungu wa Baali na kuwaguwira, wamtenda Baali Beriti kuwera mlungu gwawu. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Waisraeli walwaluwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwawu, yakawalopuziyiti kulawa muwankondu wawu wavuwa yawawazyengetiti muuwega zoseri. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Kayi, wawatendera ndiri maheri kaya ya Yeru Bahari mweni ndo Gidiyoni, kwa maheri goseri gakawatenderiti Israeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleki, mwana gwa Gidiyoni, kawagendera walongu na wana woseri wa makabila ga mawu gwakuyi kumji gwa Shekemu, kawagambira, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Mtakuli palapanu kulongolu kwa wanalushi woseri wa Shekemu. Loshi liherepa kwa mwenga, handa wana woseri malongu saba wapalu wa Yeru Baali wawakoli mlima ama mwana yumu? Mliholi handa neni na mwazi gwenu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />“Walongu wa mawu gwakuyi wabwera visoweru avi Shekemu koseri toziya yakuwi, na wantu woseri wa Shekemu wamuwa kumfata Abimeleki toziya kaweriti mlongu gwawu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Wampanana vipandi malongu saba vya mpiya vyaviweriti kunumba ya Baali Beriti vyeni kavitenderiti kuwalipa wantu wadoda na wantu yawafaa ndiri su wamfati. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Wagenda pamuhera Ofura kwa tati gwakuyi na aku kawalaga walongu wakuyi woseri malongu saba pampindi pa libuhi limu. Kumbiti Yotamu, mwana mpusu gwa Yeru Baali kaponikiti, toziya kalififiti. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Wana lushi woseri wa Shekemu na Beti Milo wajojonikiti kumwaloni yaguweriti pakwegera na mnala aku Shekemu, wamtenda Abimeleki kawera mfalumi gwawu. <verse eid="JDG 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu pawamgambiriti visoweru avi, kagenditi kugoloka pampindi pa lugongu Gerizimu, katakuliti kwa liziwu likulu, “Mumpikanili, mwenga wenikaya wa Shekemu pamfira Mlungu kawapikiniri na mwenga. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Lishaka limu, mitera igenditi kulisakulira mfalumi gwa kuyikolamlima. Su, igugambira mzeyituni, gutukolimlima twenga! <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Kumbiti mzeyituni gwankula, mwe mwona mbeza kuleka lihengu lyangu lya kunyawa lipaki lyeni lifiruwa nentu na wamlungu na wantu, ng'endi kuligaziya kuyikolamlima mitera? <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Shakapanu mitera igugambira mtini, gwizi gwenga gutukolimlima twenga. <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Kumbiti mtini guyiyankula, hashi, mwe mwona mbeza kuleka lihengu lyangu lya kunyawa mabwajubwaju gaherepa na ganoga, ng'endi kuyiyegeziya mitera? <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Shakapanu mitera igugambira mzabibu, gwizi gwenga guweri mkolimlima gwetu. <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Kumbiti Mzabibu iyankula, mwe mwona mbeza kuleka lihengu lyangu lya kunyawa divayi yeni inemiziya wamlungu na wantu, ng'endi kuyiyegeziya mitera? <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Upeleru wakuyi mitera yoseri igugendera mtera gwa misontu na kugugambira, gwizi gwenga gutukolimlima. <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Mtera gwa misontu iyankula, handa nakaka mfira kusyagula kuwara mfalumi, mwizi mlivagi pasi pa shiviniru sha neni. Kumbiti handa pamlema kutenda hangu, su motu na gulawi mumisontu yangu na kuyilunguziya ata mierezi ya Lebanoni.”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotamu kendereya kulonga, “Vinu su, mumtenda Abimeleki mfalumi kwa nfiru heri na uwaminika? Hashi, mwona mumtendera maheri Yeru Baali na kaya yakuyi ntambu yakafiruwitwi kwa matendu gakuyi? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Muliholi handa tati gwangu kaweriti muhatali kuhowa kwa kuwakomanira na kuwalopola kulawa kwa Wamidiyani! <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Kumbiti leru muwakomanga walongu wa tati gwangu na kuwalaga wana malongu saba pampindi pa libuwi limu, shakapanu mmutenda mwana gwa Abimaleki ntumintumi gwa tati, kaweri mfalumi gwa weni kaya wa Shekemu toziya ndo muntu gwa lukolu lwenu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Vinu Su, handa mumtendera aga kwa nfiru heri na kwa kumpanana ligoya Yeru Bali na kaya yakuyi, su, mnemeleri pamuhera na Abimeleki, na yomberi kanemeleri pamuhera na mwenga. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Kumbiti, handa ndiri, motu gulawi kwa Abimeleki na kuwalunguziya wanalushi wa Shekemu na Beti Milo, kayi motu gulawi kwa wanalushi wa Shekemu na Beti Milo na kumlunguziya Abimeleki.”<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Shakapanu, Yotamu katugila Beeri, toziya kamtiriti Abimeleki mlongu gwakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki kakolitimlima Israeli kwa Shipindi sha vinja vitatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Shakapanu Mlungu kawatenda walilewi pakati pa Abimeleki na wantu wa Shekemu, na womberi wamtendera kwa upayira. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Shitwatira ashi shilawiriti toziya ya Abimeleki na wantu wa Shekemu, weni katenditi nawu mpangu gwa kuwalaga wana sabini wa Gidiyoni, ntambu ayi itendekiti su kuwuzilira kwa mwazi gwagwitikiti. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Wantu wa Shekemu wawatuliti wantu kumpindi kuupeleru wa vigongu wawagwandiri wantu yawapita na kuwapoka vintu vyawu. Abimeleki kagambiluwa shitwatira ashi.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Lishaka limu Gaali, mwana gwa Ebedi, pamuhera na walongu wakuyi wagenditi kulikala Shekemu. Wantu wa Shekemu waweriti wamjimira.<verse eid="JDG 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Walawa na kugenda kumalambu gawu ga mizabibu, wayapa zabibu shakapanu wazikama, wanyawa divayi watenda msambu.Wingira kunumba ya mlungu gwawu waliya na walanda, shakapanu wampangira Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali, mwana gwa Ebedi, kalonga, “Abimeleki ndo gaa? Twenga panu Shekemu ndo wantu wa ntambu gaa ata tumtenderi Abimeleki? Gidiyoni na Zebuli mkulu gwakuyi vinu muwatenderi wantu wa Hamori, tati gwa Shekemu kumbiti kwa shishi, twengapa tumtenderi Abimeleki? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Handa wantu awa mewaweri pasi pangu, menumuwusiyi Abimeleki. Menumgambiri Abemeleki, gongeri mashonta waku, shapanu gwizi paweru tulikomangi.”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli, mkolamlima gwa mji, pakapikiniriti visoweru vya Gaali mwana gwa Ededi, kakalaliti nentu. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Su kamjegeriti walagilagi Abimeleki kwa bada aku Torima pakalonga, “Gaali, mwana gwa Ebedi, pamuhera na walongu wakuyi wingira kumjini Shekemu na kusongiziya wantu wa Shekemu wakulemi. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Su, guwuyi gwenga na wantu waguwera nawa, shaka sha pashiru, gunyatiri kumalambu pakwegera na mji. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Katepu mshenji pagulawira shaka sha mandawira, gugukomangi mji. Gaali pakalawa pamuhera na wantu wakuyi kwiza kukukomanga, guwatenderi ntambu yaguwo ifaa.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleki kawukiti na wantu wakuyi woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, wawagwandira wantu wa Shekemu pashiru pawawera muvipinga vyamsheshi. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Shakapanu Gaali mwana gwa Ebedi, kalawiti na kagolokiti muligomi likulu lya mji ndo Abimeleki na wantu wakuyi woseri walawiti pahala pawaweriti walififiti. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali pakawawoniti kamgambira Zebuli, “Guloli, wantu wankuselera kulawa kumpeleru za lugongu.” Zebuli kamgambira, “Gwenga guwona viviniru vya migongu gambira wantu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaali kalonga kayi, “Guloli! Wantu wankusuluka pakati pa isi na shipinga shimonga shirawa uwega wamtera gwa Mwaloni gwa Watunga.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Shakapanu Zebuli kamgambira, “Maringu gaku ga koshi vinu? Gwenga ndiri yagutakuliti, Abimeleki ndo gaa? Ntambu gaa tumtenderi? Vinu, awa ndo wantu waguwabeziti, gugendi gukalikomangi nawa.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaali kalawa pakawalonguziya wantu wa Shekemu na kulikomanga na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Gaali kasinda na kutuga, Abimeleki kamwingawinga. Na Wantu wavuwa watenduwiti na kuguwa munjira mpaka kuligomi likulu lya mji. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki kalikala Aruma na Zebuli kamuwinga Gaali na walongu wakuwi kulawa mji gwa Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Lishaka lyalifatiti, Abimeleki kapatiti visoweru handa wantu wa Shekemu walawa kumjini na kugenda kumalambu. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Katola wantu wakuyi kawabagula muvipinga vitatu, su wagenda kugwandira kumalambu. Pawawawoniti wantu wankulawa kumjini, kalawa kwakalififiti kawalaga. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki na shipinga shakuyi wagenda mbiru kugenda kulolera ligomi likulu lya mji. Vipinga vyakuyi viwili vimonga viwakomangiti walii yawaweriti mumalambu na kuwalaga. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleki kalikomangiti na wenikaya wa mji agu lishaka lyoseri. Kagulopola mji na kuwalaga wantu woseri yawaweriti amu. Kagulunguziya mji agu kwa motu na kugulekera munu.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Wantu woseri yawaweriti mu liboma lya Shekemu pawapikiniriti visoweru avi watugiliti wagenditi ku shumba shashiweriti pasi pa litapaka kunumba ya mlungu yawamshemiti Eli Beriti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki pakapikiniriti handa wantu woseri walijojonira kuliboma. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />“Abimeleki na wantu wakuyi woseri yawaweriti nayu wagenda kulugongu Salimoni, katola liwagu kakata lutambi lwa mtera na kulutula mliwega lyakuyi. Shakapanu kawagambira wantu walii yakaweriti nawa mtendi kalongola ntambu yakantenditi neni.” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Su kila yumu kadumula litambi handa lulii lya Abimeleki. Watola ntambi zawu nakutula pampindi yapaweriti mu liboma, wagapimbika motu na wantu woseri wayaweriti mshumba sha pasi wahowiti na womberi waweriti wantu elufu yimu wapalu kwa wadala.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Shakapanu Abimeleki kagenda Tebesi, kaluzyegeta na kugutola kwa makakala. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Kumbiti kuweriti na shindwalingu gugangamala pakati pa mji. Su, weni kaya woseri wa mji agu wapalu na wadala watugira amu na kulitatira mngati. Wakwena kushitwiku sha shindwalingu agu. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki kasokiti kushindwalingu na kugukomanga, shakapanu, kalisegeleriti ligomi lya shindwalingu su kalilunguziyi motu. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Na mdala yumu kamwasira lwala pamtuyi, limposhola Abimeleki kumtuwi. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Shakapanu Abimeleki kamshema kalong'ola mntemba gwakuyi yakajegiti vintu vyakuyi vya nkondu kamgambira, “Gutoli shimagi shikulu shaku gundagi, Wantu nawalonga handa ndaguwitwi na mdala.” Mntemba ulii katola ligumba lyakuyi, kamsoma na kumlaga. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Waisraeli pawawoniti handa Abimeleki kahowa, wawuka na kuwuya kila muntu ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Hangu Mlungu ndo ntambu yakamwazibiti Abimeleki kwa likosa lyakuyi kwa tati gwakuyi kwa kuwalaga walongu wakuyi sabini. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Ntambu iraa Mlungu kawazibiti wantu wa Shekemu kwa ukondola wawu yawautendi. Hangu, pangira ya Yotamu mwana gwa Yeru Baali iwapata.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Pakahowiti kala Abimeleki, Tola mwana gwa Pua mwana gwa Dodo gwa likabila lya Isakari, kawera mlopuziya gwa Waisraeli. Tola kalikaliti Shamili muisi ya migongu ya Efraimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Kaweriti mtoza gwa Israeli kwa mivinja ishilini na tatu, shakapanu kahowiti na kusilwa aku Shamiri.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Pa Tola, Yairi gwa Gileadi kawera mtoza gwa Waisraeli kwa mivinja ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yairi kaweriti na wana wapalu selasini waweriti wakweniti punda selasini na waweriti na lushi selasini muisi ya Gileadi, yeni mpaka leru ishemuwa Hawoti Yairi. Hawoti Yairi mana yakuwi vijiji vya Yairi. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yairi kahowiti na kufindirwa aku Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefuta kawera mtoza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Waisraeli watenditi kayi ukondola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu wawatenderiti Mabaali na Maashitaroti na wamlungu wa Aramu ya Sidoni ya Mowabu na wamlungu wa wantu wa Amoni na wamlungu wa wantu wa Wafilisti. Wamleka Mtuwa Mlungu na pota kumguwira kayi.<verse eid="JDG 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gakalipa kwa Israeli na yomberi kawatenda Wafilisti na Waamoni wawakanki. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Kwa vinja semanini awa wawatabisiyiti na kuwayonera Waisraeli yawalikaliti aku Gileadi musemu ya Waamoni kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Waamoni na womberi walokiti lushemba Yoridani kulikomanga na makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini na Efraimu. Hangu Waisraeli watabikiti nentu.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Su wamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu, pawalonga, “Tutenda vidoda kwa gwenga, mana tukuleka gwenga Mlungu gwetu, Tuwatendera mabaali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Na yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambira, “Hashi, neni nuwalopuziya ndiri kulawa kwa Wamisri na Waamoni na Waamori na Wafilisti. <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Wasidoni na Waameleki na Wamidiyani wawayonera mwenga mundilira na neni nuwalopuziya kulawa kwa womberi? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Kumbiti mwenga mundeka, muwatendera wamlungu wamonga. Hangu hapeni mbuyiri kayi kuwalopola. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Mgendi mwakawaliliri wamlungu awa yamuwasyaguliti. Muyileki iwalopuziyi muntabika zyenu!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Kumbiti Waisraeli wamgambira Mtuwa Mlungu, “Tutenda vidoda. Gututendi ntambu yagufira, kumbiti tukuluwa gutulopuziyi leru.”<verse eid="JDG 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Shakapanu wasira kutali wamlungu wahenga, wamtendera kayi Mtuwa Mlungu. Mtuwa Mlungu kaweziti ndiri kuhepelera nentu kuwona ntabiku za Waisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Waamoni walijojonila kunyawa malingu gawu aku Gileadi. Waisraeli nawomberi wajojonika na kunyawa malingu mungonjeru zawu aku Mizipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Walongoziya wa wantu wa Gileadi walikosiyana, “Gaa hakanji kulikomanga na Waamoni? Yakafira kutenda hangu ndo hakaweri mkulu gwa wenikaya woseri wa Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Aku Gileyadi kuweriti na muntu shikambaku yawamshemiti Yefuta, mwana gwa mawu yumu mhumba, na tati gwakuyi yawamshemiti Gileyadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gileyadi kaweriti viraa na wana wamonga kwa mdala gwakuyi mweni. Wana wa mdala ayu pawaweriti wakulu, wamwingiti Yefuta kulawa ukaya, wamgambira, “Gwenga gwahera uhala kulawa kwa tati gwetu, toziya, gwenga gwa mwana gwa mdala yumonga.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Su, Yefuta kawatira walongu wakuyi kagenda kulikala muisi ya Tobu. Aku wantu wadoda waweriti pamuhera na yomberi wamfata, wagenda nayu pakagenditi kulikomanga.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Pa shaka tunga, Waamoni wawakomangiti Waisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Shaka pawaweriti wankulikomanga na Waamoni, wazewi wa Gileyadi wagenda kumjega Yefuta kulawa isi ya Tobu, <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Wamgambira, “Gwizi gutulonguziyi munkondu patulikomanga na Waamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Kumbiti Yefuta kawagambira wazewi awa wa Gileyadi, “Hashi, ndo munkalaliliriti ndiri ata muwinga kulawa kwa walongu wa tati gwangu? Kwa shishi vinu munizira pamuhera mukutabika?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Wazewi awa wa Gileyadi wamgambira, “Ndo mana tukwizira vinu su gugendi na twenga kulikoma na Waamoni, na patuwakanka kala gwenga haguweri mlonguziya gwetu na gwa wantu woseri yawalikala Gileyadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta kawagambira wazewi awa wa Gileyadi, “Handa pang'enda na mwenga kulikoma na Waamoni shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kantenda niwakanka, neni haweri mlonguziya gwenu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Wazewi walii wa Gileadi wamgambira Yefuta, “Mtuwa Mlungu hakaweri kapitawu pakati pa twenga. Nakaka hatutendi ntambu yagulongiti.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Yefuta kagenda pamuhera na Wazewi wa Gileadi, na wantu wamtenda mtuwa gwawu na mlongoziya gwawu munkondu. Yefuta kulogolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga kayi matakuluwa gakuyi goseri kawagambiriti wazewi.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Yefuta katuma walagilagi kwa mfalumi gwa Amoni kamgambira, “Gwana ndewu gaa na twenga ata gwiza kuyikomanga isi twenga?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Mfalumi gwa Amoni kawawankula walagilagi awa, “Waisraeli pawalawiti Misri, watoliti isi ya neni kulawa lushemba Arinoni mpaka lushemba Yaboki na lushemba Yoridani. Hangu mumbuziliri isi ya twenga kwa ponga.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta katuma kayi walagilagi kwa mfalumi gwa Amoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />Mumugambiri Yefuta kalonga, “Waisraeli watoliti ndiri isi ya Wamowabu pota isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Shaka Waisraeli pawalawiti Misri, wagenditi kushiwala mpaka bahari ya Shamu mpaka Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Shakapanu Waisraeli watuma walagilagi kwa mfalumi gwa Edomu wamluwa kawajimiri kupita muisi yakuyi. Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Edomu kalema. Su wamluwa njimiru mfalumi gwa Moabu na yomberi viraa kalema. Hangu Waisraeli wasigala Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Shakapanu wagenda kupitira kushiwala kuzyengeta isi ya Edomu na Mowabu mpaka pawasokiti uwega wagulawa mshenji wa Moabu. Wanyawa ng'onjeru kumwambu kulushemba Arinoni, kumbiti wingira ndiri muenewu lya Moabu. Lushemba Arinoni ndo lwaluweriti mumbaka ya Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Panu Waisraeli wawatumiti walagilagi kwa Mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori aku Heshiboni, wamluwa kawajimiri kupita muisi yakuyi wagendi muisi yawu. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Kumbiti Sihoni kawajimira ndiri Waisrali wapiti muisi yakuyi. Su, Sihoni kajojonira wantu wakuyi woseri, watula ng'onjeru aku Yahasa, kalikomanga na Waisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Na yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kamtenda Sihoni pamuhera na wantu wakuyi woseri wasindi na Waisraeli. Hangu Waisraeli watola isi yoseri ya Waamoni yawaweriti walikala. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Walitola enewu lyoseri lya Waamori kwanjira lushemba Arinoni mpaka lushemba Yaboki, na kwanjira kushiwala uwega wagulawa mshenji mpaka uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu wa Israeli, kayitola isi kwa Waamori. Hashi, gwenga gufira kutupoka isi ya twenga? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Gutosheki na shilii mlungu gwaku Kemoshi kakupanana. Kumbiti isi yoseri Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu yakawawingiti wenikaya wakuyi na kutupanana twenga ayi ndo yetu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Hashi gwenga ndo gwa makakala nentu kuliku Balaki mwana gwa Zipori yakaweriti mfalumi gwa Moabu? Yomberi kashindaniti ndiri na Waisraeli ama kulikoma nawa. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Shipindi shoseri Waisraeli pawalikaliti kumjini Heshiboni na vijiji vyakuyi, na lushi lwa Aroeli na vijiji vyakuyi pamuhera na lushi zoseri zaziweriti kumpekumpeku mwa lushemba Arinoni kwa shaka sha vinja miya tatu, kwa shishi guliwuziya ndiri enewu ali shaka ashi? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Neni nukukoseya ndiri shintu na ndo mana gutenda likosa pagunkomanga. Mtuwa Mlungu ulii ndo mtoza hakatozi leru pakati pa Waisraeli na wantu wa Amoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Waamoni kaupikinira ndiri ulagilagi ulii weni Yefuta kamjegeriti. <verse eid="JDG 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Shakapanu Rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu imwizira Yefuta, na yomberi kawuka na kupita Gileyadi na Manase, kawuya Mizipa muisi ya Gileyadi na kwendeleya mpaka Amoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta kamlapira Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Handa nakaka paguntenda niwakanki Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />su, shoseri shanaliwona nashi shashilawa shaka pambuya kuwakomanga Waamori, ashi hashiweri sha gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu, hanikulaviliri tambiku ya kulunguziwa.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Su, Yefuta kaloka lushemba, kalikomanga na Waamoni. Na Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda kawakanki Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Kalitolera ukanka mkulu, kalopola miji ishilini yayiweriti pakati pa Aroeri, seemu zazizyengetiti Miniti na Abeli Keramimu. Su Waamoni wasinda nakamu na Waisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefuta pakaweriti kankuwuya ukaya kwakuyi aku Mizipa, mhinga gwakuyi kalawa kunja kumwanka pakavina na kugomba shingoma. Na yomberi kaweriti Mwana gwakuyi gwa gweka. Yefuta kaweriti ndiri na mwana gwingi mpalu pota mdala. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefuta pakamwoniti, kapapula nguwu zakuyi kwa kwinginika na kulonga, “Gwee mhinga gwangu! Guntweziya moyu. Gwenga guwera shanziru shikulu sha matatizu kwa neni. Numlapira kala Mtuwa Mlungu na neni mbeza ndiri kumega kulirapa kwangu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Na yomberi kamgambira, “Tati, handa gumlapira Mtuwa Mlungu shintu, su guntenderi ntambu yagutakuliti, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kakuwuzililira kwa wankondu waku Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Shakapanu, kamgambira tati gwakuyi, “Nduwa shitwatira shimu ashi, gunupi shaka sha miyezi miwili, ng'endi na waganja wangu kulugongu, ndiri toziya hahowi pota kuyugwa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />“Tati gwakuyi kamjimira kagendi aku kwa miyezi miwili. Na yomberi kagenda pamuhera na waganja wakuyi, wadaya kuhowa kwakuyi pamberi pa kuyugwa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Pa miyezi miwili kawuya ukaya, shakapanu tati gwakuyi kamtendera kulinganira na usali wakuyi. Mhinga ayu kaweriti nafunda. Su, kwanjira shaka ashi kuwera na shitiba ashi Muisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Kila shinja wahinga wa Israeli wagenda kudaya kwa mashaka gamsheshi kwa kumhola mwana Yefuta gwa Gileyadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefuta na Efraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Wantu wa Efureimu wajojonikiti waloka lushemba Yoridani kushana kwa Yefuta wamgambira, “gwenga gutulekiti kugenda kunkondu kulikomanga na Waamoni, toziya gutugambira ndiri kuwera pamuhera na gwenga. Vinu na twenga hatuilunguziyi numba yaku pamuhera na gamweni mngati.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta kawagambira, “Neni pamuhera na wantu wangu tuweriti na unkondu mkulu na Waamoni. Niwaluwani muntangi kumbiti mwiza ndiri kuntanga. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Pamoniti mwiza ndiri kundopuziya, makaliru gangu gaweriti mukuhowa, ndokiti ng'enda kulikomanga na Waamoni na Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana uwezu wa kuwakanka. Hashi lishaka lya leru mwiza kulikoma na neni?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Su, Yefuta kajojonira wantu woseri wa Gileadi kalikomanga na wantu wa Efraimu. Wantu wa Gileadi wawakanka wantu wa Efraimu, Awa Waefuraimu ndo awa yawaweriti walonga. “Mwenga wantu wa Gileadi ndo watuga isi wa likabila lya Efraimu wamlawiti mulikabila lya Efraimu mgenda kulikabila lya Manasi.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Shakapanu Wagiliyadi wavilopola viroku vya lushemba Yoridani su kuyidiwa njira ya wantu wa Efraimu. Kila mala pakalawiriti mtira isi kupita aku, wantu wa Gileadi wamkosiyiti, “Hashi, gwenga ndo Mwefuraimu?” Na handa kankuliti, “Ndala,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />Wamgambiliti. “Shondi gulongi Shiboleti” kumbiti yomberi kakanta “Siboleti,” toziya Waefurahimu waweziti ndiri kulikanta weri. Panu, wamkamliti, wamlaga aku kushiloku sha lushemba Yoridani. Wantu arubaini na mbili elufu wa Efraimu wahowiziyiti makaliru gawu shaka ashi. <verse eid="JDG 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefuta kaweriti mtoza muisi ya Israeli mivinja sita. Shakapanu kahowa, kasiluwa mulushi lwakuyi aku Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibizani, Eloni, na Abidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Pa Yefuta kuhowa, Ibizani kulawa Betilehemu kawera mtoza gwa Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Yomberi kaweriti na wana wapalu selasini na wadala malongu matatu. Na wahinga wakuwi selasini kawayugiziyiti kunja kulukolu lwakuwi, na wana kawayugiriti wahinga selasinii kulawa kunja kulukolu lwakuwi. Ibizani kaweriti mtoza gwa Israeli kwa vinja saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ibizani Kahowiti, kasiluwa mulushi Betilehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Pa kuhowa Ibizani, Eloni gwa likabila lya Zebuluni, kawera mtoza gwa Israeli kwa vinja lilongu. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Na pakahowiti, kasiluwa kulushi Aiyaloni muisi ya likabila lya Zebuluni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Pa kahowiti Eloni, Abidoni mwana gwa Hileli kulawa Piratoni kawera mtoza gwa Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Yomberi kaweriti na wana wapalualubaini na wazukulu selasini mweni yawakweniti punda sabini. Kaweriti mtoza gwa Israeli kwa vinja vinani. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Shakapanu Abidoni mwana gwa Hileli Mpiratoni kahowa, kasiluwa kumjini Piratoni muisi ya likabila lya Efraimu kuisi ya migongu ya Waameleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Waisraeli watenditi kayi madoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi kawaleka wakoluwimlima na Wafilisti kwa vinja alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu aku Sora, gwa likabila lya Dani, litawu lyakuyi Manoa. Mdala gwakuyi kaweriti ndiri na wana toziya kaweriti mbendi. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Lishaka limu, Lihoka gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawira mdala ayu, kamgambira shondi, “Gwenga gwahera wana toziya gwa mbendi. Kumbiti hagupati yinda na kulera mwana mpalu. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Hangu nikuluwa guliloleri weri, nagulanda divayi ama shiloweru pota naguliya shintu shoseri shashikutenda gujimiruwi ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />pa kiwuka kala mwana gwaku naguzimoga vili zakuyi nakamu. Toziya hakaweri katulwa gweka kwajili ya Mlungu, na hakanji kuwalopola Waisraeli kulawa mumakakala ga Wafilisti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Mdala ayu kagenda kumgambira mpalu gwakuyi, “Muntu gwa Mlungu ulii sheni shakuyi shiweriti shitiriziya nentu handa sha ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mlungu kaniziriti. Numkosiya ndiri kwakalawiti pota kang'ambira ndiri litawu lyakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Kumbiti kang'ambiriti handa haweri na yinda na kulera mwana mpalu. Kang'ambiziya nananda divayi ama shiloweru pota kuliya shoseri shashijimiruwa ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu, mana mwana ayu hakaweri katulwa gweka kwajili ya Mlungu kwanjira kwiwuka kwakuwi mpaka kuhowa kwakuwi.?”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Shakapanu Manoa kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Nikuluwa gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gumtumi kayi muntu gwaku ulii yagumtumiti su katufundi mirandu yatufiruwa kumtendera mwana ayu yakiza kwiwuka.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakupikinira kuluwa kwa Manoa, na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ulii gwa Mlungu kamgendera kayi mdala ulii pakaweriti kalikala kulilambu. Kumbiti mpalu gwakuyi, Manoa, kaweriti ndiri pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Mdala katuga kalongola, kamgambira mpalu gwakuyi, “Guloli! Muntu ulii yakaniziliti lishaka lilii kandawira kayi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa kawuka kamfata mdala gwakuyi wiza kwa muntu uli, kamkosiya, “Hashi, gwenga ndo muntu ulii yaguyowiriti na mdala ayu?” Muntu ulii kamwankula, “Ndo neni.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Shakapanu Manoa kalonga, “Vinu visoweru vyaku pavitimiya mwana ayu hakalikali makaliru ga ntambu gaa na lihengu lyakuyi ndo shishi?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula Manoa, “Mdala gwaku kafiruwa kwiza kugakola goseri ganumgambiriti. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Nakalawalira viboga vyoseri vyavilawirana na Mzabibu, nakalanda divayi ama shiloweru nakuliya shoseri shashijimiruwa ndiri na Mlungu. Vyoseri vyanimgambiriti kavitendi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa kamgambira Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu ayu, “Shondi, gulikali shididini tukutandiri mbuzi mdidika.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu ulii kamgambira Manoa, “Ata handa pamnkakanika kulikala hapeni ndiyi shiboga shenu. Kumbiti handa pamtanda tambiku ya kulunguziwa, mumlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu. Manoa kavimana ndiri handa ayu kaweriti Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Su, Manoa kamgambira Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, “Gutugambiri litawu lyaku su tukupanani ligoya shaka visoweru vyaku pavitimiya.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Hashi gufira kulimana litawu lyangu, toziya litawu lyangu lya kulikangasha.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Panu Manoa katanda mbuzi mdididki na tambiku ya ubumu, kavitula pambindi pa litalawu kamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu yakatenda mauzauza. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Su shaka Manoa na mdala gwakuyi wankulola motu gwa gutenda lipulipu kugenda kumpindi kulawa pakutambikila, wamwona Ntumintumi mulipulipu mlii pakakwena kugenda kumpindi. Su Manoa na mdala gwakuyi wasuntamala makukama.<verse eid="JDG 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Manoa kavimana handa ayu kaweriti Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Ntumintumi kamlawira kayi ndiri Manoa na mdala gwakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Su, Manoa kamgambira mdala gwakuyi, “Nakaka hatuhowi, toziya tumwona Mlungu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Kumbiti mdala gwakuyi kamwankula, “Handa Mtuwa Mlungu mekafili kutulaga mekajimiri ndiri tambiku yetu ya kulunguziwa na yaubumu, mekatulanguziyi ndiri vitwatira avi vyoseri ama kutugambira mirandu ayi shaka ashi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Shakapanu mdala gwakuyi Manoa kalera mwana mpalu, na Manoa kampanana litawu Samsoni. Mwana ayu kakula na Mtuwa Mlungu kamtekelera. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yanja kumtendiziya pakawera aku Mahane Dani, Pakati pa Sola na Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Mdala kulawa Timna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Lishaka limu, Samsoni kasulukiti na kugenda Timna kweni kamwoniti mhinga yumu Mfilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Pakawuyiti ukaya kawagambira walera waku, “Nimwona mhinga yumu Mfilisti aku Timna. Muheteri mhinga ayu.” <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Kumbiti walera wakuwi wamgambira, “Hashi, kwahera mhinga yoseri muwamu mwa walongu waku ama pakati pa wantu wetu ata gugendi kuheta kwa Wafilisti yawingira ndiri jandu?” Kumbiti Samsoni kamgambira tati gwakuyi, “Mheteri mhinga ayu, toziya kaherepa nentu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Walera wakuwi wavimaniti ndiri handa agu guweriti mpangu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kankumtanda Samsoni su kawakangi Wafilisti. Shaka ashi, Wafilisti wawakolitimlima Waisraeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samsoni na walera wakuwi wawukiti kugenda Timna. Pawasokiti aku kulilambu lya mizabibu, vumu simba mdidini yumu kalawira na yomberi kaweriti pakawunguluma kumgendera Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Vumu, Rohu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda Samsoni kaweri na likakala, kampapula simba ayu kwa mawoku gakuyi handa muntu yakampapuliti mwana gwa mbuzi. Na Samsoni kawagambira ndiri walera wakuwi shakashitenditi. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Pawasokiti Timna Samsoni kagenda kuyowera na mhinga ulii, mhinga ayu yakamfiliziya nentu Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Pa mashaka gavuwa ndiri kawuyiti aku Timna kumtola mhinga ayu. Pakaweriti munjira kasepuka kumbwega kulola shifuwiru shilii sha simba, na kumbiti kuweriti na wanjushi na lwashi mushifuwiru sha simba ulii. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Su, kayamba lwashi kwa mawoku gakuyi kaweriti kankuliya agawu pakendereya na mwanja gwakuyi. Pakawuyiti kwa walera wakuwi, kawapanana lwashi shididini na womberi waliya. Kumbiti kawagambiriti ndiri handa kalaviyiti lwashi alu mngati mshifuwiru sha simba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Tati gwakuwi kagenda ukaya kwa mhinga ulii na Samsoni katenda msambu aku, ntambu yawatenda wantemba shaka ashi. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Wafilisti pawamwoniti Samsoni wamjegera wantemba selasini walikali na yomberi kumsambu. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni kawagambira, “Hantambi shitendawili. Handa pamuweza kushiyambula shitendawili ashi kwa shipindi sha mashaka saba ga msambu gwa ndowa, su, haniwapanani nguwu nfufu selasini na nguwu selasini za msambu. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Kumbiti pamuweza ndiri kushiyambula, mwenga hamnupi nguwu nfufu selasini na nguwu selasini za msambu.” Na womberi wamgambira, “Aya gutambi shitendawiri ashi.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Kawagambira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Kwa mliya kulawira kuliya shiboga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">kwa yakana likakala kunoga.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">Pamashaka matatu wantemba waweriti waweza ndiri kuyambula shitendawili ashi.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Lishaka lya saba wamgambira mdala gwakuwi Samsoni, “Gumzyangizyangi mpalu gwaku su katugambili mana ya shitendawili ashi, hera hangu hatukulunguziyi kwa motu gwenga pamuhera na numba ya tati gwaku. Hashi, mtushemiliti panu kwiza kutupoka lunda zetu?” <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Mdala gwa Samsoni kamgendera Samsoni, agawu masozi pagalawa, “Gwenga gunkalalira hera gunfira ndiri. Guwatambiriti wantemba wa twenga shitendawili kumbiti neni gung'ambira ndiri.” Kumbiti Samson kamwankula, “Neni niwagambira ndiri ata walera wangu, vinu hawezi hashi kukugambira gwenga?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Kumbiti kendereyiti kulila shaka shoseri shashisigaliti sha mashaka saba ga msambu gwa ndowa. Lishaka lya saba Samsoni kamgambira mdala gwakuwi mana ya shitendawili shilii toziya kamubabanikiti nentu. Mdala gwakuwi kagenda kamukamu kawagambira wantu wakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Lishaka ali lya saba, pamberi pa mshenji kwinala, wamgambira Samsoni, “ndo shintu gaa shinoga kuliku lwashi? Ndo gaa kana likakala kuliku simba?” Samsoni kawankula, “Handa memulimi ndiri na ng'ombi gwa shididini memuwezi ndiri kushiyambula shitendawili shangu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Panu rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu imwizira Samsoni kwa likakala, na yomberi kagenda kumjini Ashikeloni, kawalaga wantu selasini, shakapanu katola nguwu zawu za msambu, kawapanana walii wawayambuliti shitendawili shakuyi. Shakapanu kawuka, kagenda ukaya kwa walera wakuwi pakawera na maya. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Na mdala gwakuwi Samsoni wamhetiziya kwa ganja gwakuyi yakaweriti mgolokera lishaka lya ndowa yakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />“Pa shaka tunga, shaka sha kubenanga nganu, Samsoni katoliti mwana gwa mbuzi, kagenditi kumtyangira mdala gwakuwi. Kamgambira mganafu gwakuwi handa kafira kumlola mdala gwakuwi kushumba shakuyi. Kumbiti mganafu gwakuwi kamubelera nakagenda,” <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />mganafu kwakuyi kamgambira, “Neni niliholiti handa gumlema nakamu. Hangu numyugiziya yumu gwa ganja gwaku. Ata hangu, mpusu gwakuwi kaherepa nentu kuliku yomberi. Gumyugi ayu pa yomberi.” <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni kamgambiriti, “Mwanja agu paniwatenda Wafilisti hapeni weri na vidoda.”<verse eid="JDG 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Samsoni su kagenda, kawakamla vibweta miya tatu na kawatawa mishira yawu pamuhera wawiliwawili. Shakapanu katula mambamba mukila shipinga sha vibweta. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Shakapanu kayipamba motu na kuwalekiziya wavibweta awa wingiriti kumalambu ga Wafilisti na kulunguziya ng'anda za nganu na nganu yayiweriti yankali kubenanga ata na malambu ga mizabibu na mtera ya mizeyituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Wafilisti pawafiliti kuvimana yakatenditi aga, wawagambiliti, “Ndo ayu Samsoni, mganafu kulawa Timna, katenda aga toziya mganafu gwakuwi kamyugiziyiti mdala gwakuwi kwa mntemba yumu yakaweriti ganja gwakuyi lishaka lya ndowa ya Samsoni.” Su Wafilisti wagenda kumlunguziya motu mdala ulii pamuhera na tati gwakuwi.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni kawagambira Wafilisti, “Handa aga ndo gamtenditi, nulilapa handa hapeni mbuki mpaka mbuziliri gamntendiriti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Su, kawakomanga na kuwalaga wavuwa. Shakapanu kagenda kulikala mumpanga ya litalawu lya Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni kakuwakanka Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Wafilisti wiza, watula kambi yawu muisi ya Yuda na kweneya mpaka mji gwa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Wantu wa Yuda wamkosiya, “Hashi mwiza kutukomamanga?” Na womberi wawankula, “Twiza su tumtawi Samsoni na kumtendera ntambu yakatutenderiti.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Su, wantu elufu tatu wa Yuda wamgendera Samsoni kumpanga mwa litalawu lwa Etamu wamgambira, “Hashi guvimana ndiri handa Wafilisti watukola mlima twenga? Guloli su, madoda gagututenderiti!” Samsoni kawankula, “Handa vyawantendiriti ndo ntambu yaniwatenderiti.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Wamgambira, “Twiza kukutawa su tukutuli mumawoku mwawu.” Samsoni kawagambira, “Mnapiri handa maweni mwenga hapeni mndagi.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Na womberi wamgambira, “Twenga hapeni tukulagi ila hatukutawi hera na kukutula mumakakala mwawu.” Su, wamtawa kwa ngoyi mbili zyasyayi na kumlaviya amu mumpanga.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Pakasokiti Lehi, Wafilisti wamgendiriti mbiru agawu pawashowangana. Vumu Rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda kaweri na likakala na ngoyi zilii zawamtawiti mumawoku mwakuwi zikutukanga handa mikota ya majani yagakoliti motu na ntawaliru zituluka pasi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samsoni kapata lisaya liwisi lya punda, kalitendera kuwalaga wantu elufu yimu, <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Shakapanu Samsoni kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">kwa lusaya lwa punda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“ndaga wantu elufu yimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kwa lusaya lwa punda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">njojonira matita ga mauti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Katepu pakamaliliti kutakula, kasa lisaya alu. Pahala palii kapashema Ramati Lehi, mana yakuyi ndo lugongu lwa lisaya.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Shakapanu Samsoni kayumuluwiti nentu. Su, kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pakalonga, “Gwee Mlungu, gwenga ndo yagujegiti ukanka awu, kwa kuntendera neni ntumintumi gwaku. Hashi, vinu gundeki nfuwi na kuyumiluwa? Na kutolwa kwa makakala na Wafilisti awa yawingira ndiri jandu?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Mlungu kagubutula pahala yapaweriti na lilindi aku Laki, kanyililiziya mashi. Samsoni kalanda mashi aga na likakala lyakuyi limuwuyira. Bwiru ayi wayishema Eni Hakore, yeni ayi ya aku Lehi mpaka leru.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsoni kaweriti mtoza gwa Waisraeli kwa mivinja malongu mawili, shaka sha Wafilisti pawaweriti wankukolamlima isi.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni aku Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Lishaka limu Samasoni kagenditi kumjini Gaza, kaliwona na mhumba yumu yomberi kagonja nayu. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Wantu wa Gaza pawagambilitwi handa Samsoni kaaku, wayizyengeta seemu ayi na kumgwandira kuligomi likulu lya lushi pashiru poseri. “Walikala jii aku kuligomi pashiru poseri pawahola handa waweza kumhepera mpaka mandawira su wamlagi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Kumbiti Samsoni kasigala kumjini mpaka pashiru ligonugonu. Shaka sha pashiru ligonugonu kimuka kakola vizingiti vya ligomi lya mji, kavitupula pamuhera na makomewu gakuyi kapapa mumawega na kugenda nazi mpaka kuupeleru wa lugongu lwalulolana na Hebroni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Delira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Pa aga, Samsoni kamfiriti mdala yumu yakashemitwi Delila mweni kalikaliti mlulalanda lwa Soreki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Wakulu wa Wafilisti wamwizira Delila, wamgambira, “Gumzyangizyangi Samsoni su tuvimani shanjiru sha likakala lyakuyi livuwa tuwezi kumbata na kumtawa. Pagutenda aga, kila yumu gwetu hakakupanani vipandi elufu miya yimu vya madini ga mpiya.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila kamgambira Samsoni, “Shondi, Samsoni gung'ambili shanjiru sha makakala gaku likulu, na ntambu gaa muntu kaweza kukukanka na kukutawa.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni kamwankula, “Handa pawantawa kwa ngoyi saba za syayi mbisi za upindi, haweri nahera likakala handa muntu yoseri.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Wakulu wa Wafilisti wamjegera Delila ngoyi za syayi saba mbisi za upindi, na yomberi kamtawa Samsoni kwa ngoyi azi. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delira kaweriti katula wantu wamgwadiri mushumba sha mngati. Shakapanu, kamshema Samsoni kwa kubota, “Samsoni, Wafilisti wankwiza kukukomanga.” Samsoni kadumula ngoyi azi handa nyuzi zazishinkula motu. Hangu kwahera yakayambuliti shanjiru sha makakala gakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila kamgambira Samsoni, “Gwenga guzongera na guzyanga neni. Shondi gung'ambili ntambu yaguweza kutawalirwa.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsoni kamwankula, “Pawantawa kwa ngoyi za syayi zyeni hazenitumiwi, haweri nahera likakala handa muntu yoseri.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Su, Delila katola ngoyi za syayi, kamtawa nazi. Shakapanu kamshema Samsoni kwa kubota, “Samsoni! Wafilisti wiza kukukoma!” Shaka ashi kuweriti na wantu kushumba pawamgwadira, Samsoni kazikutula ngoyi azi handa uzi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila kamgambiriti Samsoni, “Mpaka vinu gwankali gwankumpayira. Gung'ambili ntambu yaguweza kutawalirwa.” Samsoni kamgambira, “Pagupota mabutu saba vya vili zyangu mushitambala sha nguwu na kuvitawalira nakamu ku mpanda ya kufumira nguwu, haweri nahera likakala handa muntu yoseri.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Shaka Samsoni pakaweriti kankugonja Delila kavipota pamuhera vishungi saba vya vili za Samsoni kavitawa kwa mushitambala sha nguwu na kuvitawalira nakamu ku mpanda. Shakapanu kamgambira Samsoni, “Samsoni! Wafilisti wankwizira.” Samsoni kimuka kulawa kumpota katupula Mpanda ilii na kutatula shitambala shlii sha nguwu.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila kamgambira Samsoni, “Guweza hashi kulonga handa gunfira kwa moyu gwaku na agawu gweneng'ambiri bada yaku? Gumpayira vinu mala ntatu. Mpaka vinu hagweni ng'ambili bada ya makakala gaku gavuwa.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila pakendereyiti kumgaziya nentu Samsoni kwa kumgambira visoweru viravi, lishaka kwa lishaka su katoka murohu sambira ya kuhowa. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Kaweza kayi ndiri kuhepelera, kamgambira bada yakuwi, pakalonga, “Vili za neni hazeni moguwi. Neni ntuluwa kulongolu kwa Mlungu kwanjira mumtima gwa mawu gwangu. Handa pamoguwa makakala gangu hagawuki, na neni haweri nahera likakala gambira muntu yoseri.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Su, Delila pakawoniti handa Samsoni kamgambira bada yakuwi yoseri, kawashema wakulu wa Wafilisti, kawagambira, “Mwizi mwanja agu gumu hera mana Samsoni kang'ambira bada yakuwi yoseri.” Wakulu wa Wafilisti wamgendera Delila agawu pawamjegera vipandi vya madini ga mpiya gawalagaliriti. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Na Delila kamtenda Samsoni kagonji pamawondu gakuyi, kamshema muntu kamogi mabutu gakuyi saba. Shakapanu Delila kanja kumgaziya Samsoni toziya vinu likakala lyakuyi limuwuka. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila kamshema Samsoni, “Samsoni! Wafilisti wankwizira!” Samsoni pakimukiti kumpota agawu pakalihola handa hakawezi kulilopuziya handa ntambu yakuyi. Kavimaniti ndiri handa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kamleka. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Wafilisti wamubatiti na wamjodola masu, shakapanu wamjega Gaza na wamtawa kwa pingu za shaba, na kumkakanika kutenda lihengu lya kusyaga ubumu kushibetubetu aku. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Kumbiti vili za mtuyi gwakuyi zyanjiti kukula kayi pa kumoguwa.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Wakulu wa Wafilisti wajojonikiti kunemelera na kumlavilira tambiku mlungu gwawu yawamshema Dagoni. Su, waweriti wankulonga, “Mlungu gwetu katupanana uwezu wa kumkanka mnkondu gwetu Samsoni.”<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Pawaweriti na nemeleru nentu mumiyoyu mwawu, walonga, “mumujegi Samsoni katunemiziyi.” Su kawavinira. Na womberi wamtula pakati pa mpanda mbili. <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Wantu pawamwoniti Samsoni wamzyuma mlungu gwawu na kulonga, “mlungu gwetu katupanana uwezu wa kumkanka mnkondu gwetu mhalibisiya gwa isi yetu mweni kalagiti wavuwa wetu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni kamgambira mntemba yakaweriti kamlonguziya kwa liwoku lyakuyi, “Gundeki nizipapasiyi mpanda zyazikolera numba ayi su na neni niziyegemeyi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Numba ayi iweriti imema wantu. Wakulu woseri wa Wafilisti waweriti seemu ya pampindi ya numba, kuweriti na wantu elufu tatu wapalu na wadala, pawamlola Samsoni na pawamjongera. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Shakapanu Samsoni kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu nikuluwa gunholi. Shondi gunupi likakala, mala ayi yimu hera, gwee Mlungu, su nuwawuziliri mwanja agu hera Wafilisti yawanjondoliti masu gangu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samsoni kakola mpanda mbili za pakati zyeni zazikoliliti linumba ali, liwoku lya kumshigi mpanda yimu na liwoku lya kumliwu mpanda yimonga. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Shakapanu kalonga, “Guleki nfuwi pamuhera na Wafilisti. Kasukuma kwa makakala gakuyi goseri. Linumba liguwira wakulu woseri wa Wafilisti na wantu woseri yawaweriti mngati.” Wantu yawahowi shaka lilii Samsoni pakahowiti, waweriti wavuwa kuliku walii wakawalagiti shaka sha ukomu wakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Walongu wakuyi na lukolu lwa tati gwakuyi wiza kumtola, wamsira pakati pa lushi lwa Sola na lushi lwa Eshitaoli mulipumba lya Manoa, tati gwakuwi. Samsoni kaweriti mtoza gwa Israeli kwa vinja ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Shinyagu sha Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu kumigongu ya Efuremu, litawu lyakuyi Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Lishaka limu kamgambiriti mawu gwakuwi, “Vipandi virii vya madini ga feza elufu yimu na miya yimu vyawakwiwiriti, na gwenga gumpangiriti yakakwiwiriti pampikinira, neni nanavi. Neni ndo yantoliti.” Mawu gwakuwi kalonga, “Mwana gwangu Mlungu kakutekeleri kwa kujimira kwaku.”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Mika kamuwuzilira mawu gwakuwi vipandi avi vya madini ga feza elufu yimu na miya yimu. Mawu gwakuwi kalonga, “mpangiru yandaviyiti nayikupata, feza ayi niyitula kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu su kunyawira shinyagu sha kusongola nakushigibikira na madini ga feza. Vinu hanikuwuziliri vipandi vya madini ga feza gwenga.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika pakamuwuziliriti kala mawu gwakuwi vipandi vya madini ga feza, mawu gwakuwi katola vipandi vya madini ga feza miya mbili kampanana fundi feza yomberi kasongoli shinyagu na kugibikira na madini ga feza. Shinyagu ashi shituluwa mnumba ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Muntu ayu, Mika kaweriti na pahala pakuwi pa kuguwira. Kanyawiti shizibawu na vinyagu vidikadika vmtambika na shinyagu, shakapanu kamtenda yumu gwa wana wakuwi kuwera mtambika gwakuwi.<verse eid="JDG 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Mashaka galii paweriti ndiri na mfalumi Muisraeli. Kila muntu katenditi shoseri shakawoniti shiheri pamasu gakuyi mweni.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Shaka ashi kuweriti na mntemba yumu Mlawi kumjini Betilehemu muisi ya Yuda yakalikaliti aku pakawera mhenga. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Mntemba ayu kawuka Betilehemu muisi ya Yuda, kagenda kusakula pahala pamonga pa kulikala. Mumwanja gwakuwi kasoka ukaya kwa mika muisi ya migongu ya Efureimu.<verse eid="JDG 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika kamkosiya, “Gulawa koshi?” Na yomberi kamwankula, “Neni na Mlawi, kulawa kumjini Betilehemu muisi ya Yuda. Nankusakula pahala pakulikala.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika kamgambira, “Gulikali pamuhera na neni, guweri kwaneni handa tati na mtambika gwangu. Hanukulipi vipandi lilongu vya feza kila shinja na nguwu pamuhera na vintu vyagufira.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Mlawi ayu kingira kalikala aku na kuwera handa yumu gwa wana wa mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Mika kamtula utuwa muntemba Mlawi ayu kuwera mtambika gwakuwi nayomberi kalikala ukaya kwa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Shakapanu kalonga, “Vinu nivimana handa Mtuwa Mlungu hakantenderi maheri toziya nana mntemba Mlawi ayu handa mtambika gwangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na likabila lya Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Mashaka aga kuweriti ndiri na mfalumi Muisraeli. Su likabila lya Dani liweliti lyankusakula enewu lyakuyi lya kulikala, toziya liweziti ndiri kwingira muisi yawapananwiti. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />“Hangu wantu wa likabila lya Dani wasyaguliti muwamu mwa wantu wamhanu vikambaku wawatuma kulawa Sola na Eshitaoli wawagambira wagendi kuyilolalola isi. Su wantu awa wasokiti muisi ya migongu ya Efureimu ukaya kwa Mika wagenda wagonjiti amu pashiru.” <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Pawaweriti mnumba mwa Mika, walimaniti liziwu lya muntemba Mlawi ulii. Wamgalambukila na kumkosiya, “Gaa kakujega agawu? Gwana lihengu gaa panu?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Yomberi kawankula, “Mika kandipa mpiya su ntendi lihengu lya kuwera mtambika gwakuyi.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Na womberi wamgambira, “Shondi gutukosilili kwa Mlungu tuvimani handa mwanja gwetu guherepa aku kwatugenda.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Mtambika ulii kawagambira, “Mgendi kwa ponga. Mtuwa kankugulolera mwanja gwenu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Su, wantu wamhanu awa wawuka, wasoka Laishi. Wawawoniti wantu yawalikaliti aku, na ntambu yawalikaliti weri handa wantu wa Sidoni. Waweriti wantu wanyamaliru na wahera lyoga na waweriti na kila shintu shawashifiriti muisi. Waweriti kutali na wantu wa Sidoni na waweriti ndiri na lihengu lyoseri na wantu wamonga.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Su, walolalola awa wawuyiti kwa walongu wawu aku Sola na Eshitaoli, na womberi wawakosiya, “Mtujegera visoweru gaa?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Womberi walonga, “Mwimuki tugendi na kuyikomanga isi ayi. Tuyiwona isi ayi na nakaka ndo isi yana mbotu. Hashi, hamlikali panu pota kutenda shintu? Namkawalila kugenda kuyitola kwa makakala. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Pamsoka aku hamuwawoni wantu yawalikala kwa unyamaliru. Isi ayi ndo nkulu, ipunguwa ndiri shoseri na Mlungu kawapanana uwezu wa kuyitola.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Su, wantu miya sita wa likabila lya Dani pawawera na silaa zawu za nkondu wawuka Sola na Eshitaoli. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Wagenda wanyawa malingu gawu aku kwagwinalira mshenji Kiriati Yearimu muisi ya Yuda. Ndo mana pahala palii, Kiriati Yearimu pashemuwa Mahani Dani mpaka leru. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kulawa aku wagenda isi ya migongu ya Efuremu, wasoka ukaya kwa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Wantu wamhanu walii yawagenditi kuyilolalola isi ya Laishi wawagambira walongu wawu, “Hashi, mvimana handa munumba yimu muwamu mwa azi kwana vinyagu vidikadika vya wamlungu na shinyagu shawashigibikira madini ga feza? Su, mliholi hamtendi hashi.”<verse eid="JDG 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Su walolalola walii wagenda kunumba ya Mika, wingira mnumba na kumkosiya visoweru vya mntemba Mlawi ulii na kumlamsiya. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Shaka ashi, wantu miya sita walii wa likabila lya Dani pawawera na magumba gawu ga nkondu waweriti wagoloka paligomi likulu. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Wantu walii wamhanu wawagenditi kuilolalola isi wayingiliti mngati mnumba, washitola shinyagu ashi na shizibawu shilii na vinyagu vidikadika vya wamlungu, na mtambaka kaweriti kagoloka muligomi na wamashonta yawapapiti magumba.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Shakapanu mtambika kawawoniti pawingira mnumba mwa Mika watola shinyagu sha kusongola, shifuku sha ntakuliru, na vinyagu vidikadika vya wamlungu, kawakosiya, “Mwangutenda shishi?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Na womberi wamgambira, “Gunyamali, gudiwi mlomu gwaku, gwizi pamuhera na twenga, guweri mtambika gwetu na tati gwetu. Awu guwona hashi? Ifaa kwa gwenga nentu kuwera mtambika gwa muntu yumu ama mtambika gwa likabila lya Dani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Mtambika ulii kanemelera mumoyu kutola shinyagu shirii na shizibawu na vinyagu vimonga, kagenda na wantu walii. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Su, wanja mwanja gwawu, agawu walongolerwa na wana wawu na mifugu na lunda zawu.<verse eid="JDG 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Pawaweriti wasoka kutali na ukaya kwa Mika, wantu yawaweriti pakwegera na Mika washemitwi, wawafatira wantu wa likabila lya Dani wawafikira. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Shakapanu wawatendera umatu, na womberi wantu wa likabila lya Dani wagalambuka, wamkosiya Mika, “Gwana shida gaa ata gutufatira pamuhera na shipindi shoseri ashi?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika kalonga, “Mwengapa mtola wamlungu wangu yanilinyawiliti, viraa mmutola na mtambika gwangu, mndekara ndiri shintu. Muweza hashi kunkosiya nana shida gaa?”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Wantu wa likabila lya Dani wamgambira, “Shondi guleki umatu waku, toziya wamonga wetu wana maya waweza kukukangala, na kukulaga na kuwalaga walongu waku.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Mika pakawoniti handa wamzidi makakala, kagalambuka, kawuya ukaya na likabila lya Dani wagenda zawu.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Wantu awa wa likabila lya Dani wavitoliti vintu avi vyeni Mika kaweriti kavinyawa, wamtola na ulii mtambika gwakuyi. Su wagenda kugukomanga Laishi wawalaga wenikaya wakuwi walii yawalikaliti amu kwa nyamaliru na pota lyoga, waluhalibisiya lushi alu. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Weni kaya wa lushi alu waweriti ndiri na wantu wa kuwalopola toziya waweriti kutali na mji gwa Sidoni, lushi alu luweriti kululalanda lwa Beti Rehobu. Wantu wa likabila lya Dani walunyawa kayi, walikala amu. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Wagalambuliti litawu lya mji agu, wagushema Dani, kufata litawu lya mbuyi gwawu yakaweriti mwana gwa Yakobu. Kumbiti lushi alu mashaka gapititi walushemiti Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Wantu wa likabila lya Dani washigolosiya shinyagu shilii sha kusongola, na litawu lya mtambika ayu ndo Yonatani, mwana gwa Gerishomu, mzukulu gwa Musa na wana wakuyi, waweriti watambika wa likabila lya Dani mpaka pawagenditi muisi ya kuhamisirwa. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Shaka shoseri liringu linanagala lya Mlungu paliweriti aku Shilo, wantu wa likabila lya Dani wanderiyiti kushiguwira shinyagu sha kusongola shilii Mika shakashinyawiti.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mlawi na mdala gwakuwi gwa kunja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Shaka ashi paweriti ndiri na mfalumi Muisraeli, kuweriti na Mlawi tunga yakalikaliti handa mhenga kutali muenewu mkati mwa isi ya vigongu ya Efureimu. Muntu ayu katoliti mdala ayu gwa kunja kulawa Betilehemu muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Kumbiti mdala ulii kamkalalira Mlawi ayu, kamleka kawuya ukaya kwa tati gwakuwi aku Beterehemu, kalikala kwa shaka sha miezi msheshi. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Lishaka limu, mpalu gwakuwi kagenditi kumsakula, kafiliti kuyowera nayu na kumwuziya ukaya kwakuwi. Su mpalu ayu kagenditi pamuhera na ntumintumi gwakuwi na punda wawili. Mdala uliii kamjega mngati kwa tati gwakuwi, na mganafu gwakuwi pakamwoniti kamwanka kwa kunemelera. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Mganafu gwakuwi kamshemera, na yomberi kalikala aku kwa shaka sha mashaka matatu, Mlawi ayu na ntumintumi gwakuwi waliya, walanda na kugonja aku.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Lishaka lya msheshi, wimuka mandawira putiputi, walitanda kuwuka, kumbiti mganafu gwakuyi kamgambira, “Gulii uti shididini gupati likakala, shakapanu guwuki.”<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Su wantu wawili awa walikala, waliya na kulanda pamuhera. Shakapanu mganafu gwakuwi kamgambira mganafu gwakuyi, “Shondi gugonji pashiru panu na kunemelera.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Muntu ulii pakagolokiti kuwuka, mganafu gwakuwi kamluwa kusigala, na yomberi kasigala. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Lishaka lya mhanu muntu ayu kimuka mandawira, kafira kuwuka. Kumbiti mganafu gwakuyi kamgambira, “Guheperi gupati likakala kwa kuliya, guheperi paluwala, shakapanu guwuki.” Woseri wawili waliya pamuhera.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Shakapanu Mlawi ayu na mdala gwakuyi gwa kunja pamuhera na ntumintumi gwakuwi pawagolokiti kugenda zawu, mganafu gwakuwi kamgambira Mlawi ayu, “Vinu paliwala papera na pamihi papakwegera. Gugonji panu, na kunemelera. Shirawu mandawira hagwimuki na kwanja mwanja gwa kuwuya ukaya.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Kumbiti muntu ayu kalemiti kugonja aku pashiru palii, Su, kagoloka, kawuka kasoka pakwegera na lushi lwa Yebusi aku Yerusalemu. Kaweriti na punda wawili wawayalikitwi kala, pamuhera na mdala gwakuwi gwa kunja na ntumintumi gwakuyi.<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Pawaweriti wapakwegera kumjini Yebusi, Pashiru paweriti pakwingira na ntumintumi gwakuwi kamgambira mtuwa gwakuwi, “Vinu mbaka twingiri mulushi alu lwa Wayebusi tugonji amu pashiru panu.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Mtuwa gwakuwi kamwankula, “Hapeni tugalambuki na kwingira mulushi lwa wahenga weni Waisraeli ndiri. Twendereyi na mwanja mpaka Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Tugendi tusegeleri seemu azi na kugonja aku Gibea ama Rama.”<verse eid="JDG 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Su, wendereya na mwanja gwawu mpaka mshenji gwinala wawera pakwegera na lushi lya Gibea lweni ndo lushi lwa likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Wingira kumjini wapati kugonja amu pashiru. Pawingiliti kumjini wagenda kulikala kuluwaga lwa lupalahera lwa lushi, toziya kwahera muntu yakawashemiriti kugonja ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Pawaweriti aku mzewi yumu kasoka kulawa kulilambu kwakuwi. Mzewi ayu kaweriti mweni kaya gwa isi ya migongu ya Efureimu na kaweriti kalikala aku Gibea handa mhenga. Wenikaya wa lushi lwa Gibea waweriti wa likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Mzewi ayu pakaloliti na kumwona muntu ulii yakaweriti kamumwanja pakawera kuluwaga lwa mji, kamkosiyiti, “Gulawa koshi na gwankugenda koshi?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Na yomberi kamwankula, “Tulawa Betilehemu muisi ya Yuda na twankugenda seemu za enewu lya mkati mwa migongu ya Efureimu. Aku ndo kwanilikala na vinu nankuwuya aku Betilehemu Muisi ya Yuda aku ndo ukaya, kwahera muntu panu yakatushemeliti ukaya kwakuyi, <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />tembera twana kila shintu kumbiti watwanka ndiri twana ntundu na maliwuziyu kwajili ya punda wetu. Viraa nana libumunda na divayi kwajili ya twenga wantumintumi waku, yani neni, ntumintumi gwaku mdala, pamuhera na mndemba yatufataniti ayu. Tufira ndiri shintu shoseri.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Mzewi ayu kamgambira, “Mwizi ukaya kwangu ponga iweri na mwenga! Handa kwana shipungukiti hanukupananeni. Ila namgonja kuluwaga aku.”<verse eid="JDG 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Hangu kawajega ukaya kwakuwi na kuwapanana punda wawu ntundu. Wana mwanja awa wagulula magulu gawu, walanda na kuliya.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Pawaweriti wankulinemiziya, kumbiti wapalu wadoda wa lushi alu wiza wayizyengeta numba ayu na wakota mlyangu kwa makakala. Wamgambira mzewi mweni kana numba, “Gumlaviyi mpalu yakiziti kwa gwenga, tugonja nayu.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Kumbiti mzewi kana numba ayu kalawa kunja, kawagambira, “Hangu walongu wangu, nuwaluwa namumutendera ukondola muntu ayu. Ayu ndo mhenga gwangu, hangu namumutendera udoda uwu. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Nanayu mhinga gwangu mweni ndo kankali nafunda na kapanu viraa mdala gwa kunja gwa mhenga gwangu. Mnjimili nuwalaviyi kunja, muwatoli na kuwatendera ntambu yamfira, kumbiti muntu ayu namumtendera shitwatira ashi sha soni.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Kumbiti wapalu awa wampikinira ndiri. Hangu Mlawi ulii kamtola mdala gwakuwi na kumlaviya kwawu kunja aku. Nawomberi wamtola na kumhumba kwa makakala pashiru poseri mpaka mandawira. Pakwegera na kushiya, wamleka kagendi zakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Mandawira, mdala ulii kiza mpaka paligomi lya numba mwakaweriti mpalu gwakuwi, kaguwa pasi paligomi palii na kulikala palii mpaka pakulangaliti nakamu.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mpalu gwa mdala ayu pakimkiti mandawira kavugula ligomi lya numba, kalawa kunja su kendereyi na mwanja, ndo kamwona mdala gwakuwi kashikola shizingiti sha pasi paligomi. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Kamgambira, “gugoloki tugendi.” Kumbiti yomberi kankula shintu ndiri. Kamtola, kamtula kumpindi kwa punda gwakuwi na kumjega mpaka ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Pakasokiti ukaya kwakuwi katola shimagi na kumhanjahanja mdala ulii vipandi lilongu na viwili. Shakapanu kavijega kila shipandi mu kila likabila lya Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Woseri walii wawawoniti walongiti, “Ee shitwatira ashi shidoda nentu hasheni lawiri pota kuwoneka kwanjira lishaka lilii Waisraeli pawalawiti muisi ya Misri mpaka leru. Tuliholi twaweni na twamuwi shitwatira sha kutenda.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankulitanda kwa nkondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli, kulawa ku mji gwa Dani mpaka Beeri Sheba, pamuhera na wantu wa isi ya Gileadi wawera shipinga shimu, walijojonira aku Mizipa, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Walongoziya woseri wa makabila ga Israeli walivaga mumpenyu zawu kulongolu kwa lijojoniru lwa wantu wa Mlungu. Wamashonta wa magulu yawana magumba laki elufu msheshi. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Na womberi wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini, wapata visoweru handa wantu wayawu wa Israeli wakwena kugenda Mizipa. Su Waisraeli wamkosiya mdala Mlawi, “Gutugambiri, ukondola awu utendeka hashi?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Mlawi ulii, mpalu gwa mdala ulii yawamlagiti, kawankula, “Neni na mdala gwangu tusokiti kumjini Gibea, mji gwa likabila lya Benjamini su tugonji aku pashiru. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Kumbiti wenikaya wa mji gwa Gibea wiza pashiru wayizyengetiti numba mwaweriti ng'onja. Wafiriti wandagi, ira wamgonjiti kwa makakala mdala gwangu mpaka kahowa. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Neni ntola mauti gakuyi, numhanjangahanjanga na kuvijega kila shipindi kwa kila likabila lya Israeli, toziya watenda shitwatira sha udoda na sha soni Muisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Vinu mwenga Waisraeli woseri, mlitakuziyi na mlaviyi shampangiti.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Wantu woseri kwa pamuhera, wagoloka handa muntu yumu walonga, “kwahera yoseri pakati petu yanakawuyi mliringu lyakuyi ama ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Hangu ndo ntambu yanatuwatenderi Gibea. Hatugalambuli simbi na kulola likabila gaa haligendi kulikomanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Hatusyaguli wantu lilongu mukila wantu miya yimu wa Israeli, wantu miya yimu mukila wantu elufu yimu, wantu elufu yimu mukila wantu elufu lilongu. Awa hawaweri na lihengu lya kuwajegera shiboga wayawu, yawawera na lihengu lya kugukomanga mji gwa Gibea muisi ya Benjamini kwa ukontola wawu wa soni yawautenditi muisraeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Hangu wapalu woseri wa Israeli wajojonika kwa moyu gumu kwajili ya kugukomanga mji gwa Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Wantu wa makabila ga Israeli watuma walagilagi kwa wantu wa likabila loseri lya Benjamini, pawalonga, “Hashi, ndo ukontola gaa awu yamuwutenditi pakati petu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Vinu mtupanani wantu awa wadoda wa Gibea su tuwalagi na kuwusiya ukondola awu mkulu kulawa Israeli.” Kumbiti wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini waweriti ndiri kala kuwapikinira walongu wawu Waisraeli wamonga. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Kumbiti wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini walijojonira aku Gibea kulawa mukila miji yawu, kugenda kulikoma na wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini walijojoniliti kulawa lushi zawu mashonta malongu mawili na sita elufu wawatumiya vimagi vikulu, na womberi wana lushi lwa Gibea wajojonira wantu miya saba yawawasyaguliti. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Pakati pa wantu awa yawasyagulitwi elufu ishilini na sita kuweriti na wantu miya saba yawatumiyiti liwoku lwa kumshigi, kila yumu kaweziti kaguma libuwi kwa kombewu na kuluguma luvili pota kulukosa. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Waisraeli, paguleka likabila lya Benjamini, wawajojoniriti wantu miya msheshi elufu yawaweza kutendera magumba. Woseri waweriti wagangamala wa nkondu.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila gamonga ga Israeli wankuwakoma Wabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />“Waisraeli wagenda pahala pa kuguwira aku Beteli kumkosiya Mlungu, wapati kuvimana likabila gaa haligendi kwanja kulikomanga na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini. Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga handa likabila lya Yuda ndo haligendi uti.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Su, Waisraeli wimuka mandawira wagenda, kutula malingu gawu pakwegera na lushi lwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Waisraeli wagenda na kuwatula wamashonta wawu kulikomanga na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini aku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini walawa kunja kulushi lwa Gibea walikomanga na Waisraeli, wawalaga wantu wa Israeli malongu mawili na mbili elufu. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Kumbiti Waisraeli walipanana moyu, walitanda kayi kwa nkondu pahala palii pawagolokiti kwa mala ya kwanja. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Pamberi pa panu Waisraeli wagenda kumguwira Mlungu, wamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu mpaka pashimihi. Shakapanu wamkosiya Mtuwa Mlungu “Hashi, tugendi kayi kulikoma na walongu wetu wa likabila lya Benjamini?” Mtuwa kawankula, “Mkweni mkalikomi nawa.” <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Hangu lishaka lya pili Waisraeli wasegelera kulikoma na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Lishaka lya pili wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini walawa Gibea na kuwakomanga Waisraeli, wawalaga Waisraeli elufu lilongu na nani yawaweriti wavimana kulikoma. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Wamashonta woseri wa Israeli wawasigaliti wakwena kugenda Beteli. Walikala aku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pawadaya na koya kuliya mpaka pashimihi. Wamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za kulunguziya na tambiku za ponga. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Waisraeli wamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu aku shakutenda aku Beteri. Shaka ashi lisanduku lwa lipatanu lya Mtuwa paliweriti aku, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finehasi mwana gwa Eleazari, mwana gwa Aroni kaweriti mtambika. Waisraeli wamkosiya Mtuwa, “Hashi, tugendi kayi kulikomanga na walongu wetu wantu wa likabila lya Benyamini?” Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambira, “Mkweni. Shirawu haniwapanani uwezu hamuwakanki.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Hangu, Waisraeli watula wamashonta mumafifu kuzyengeta mji gwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Waisraeli wagenditi kulikomanga na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini mulishaka lya tatu. Wavitula vipinga vyawu pahala pakuyi ntambu yawatenditi Gibea kwanja. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Shakapanu wantu wa likabiala lya Benjamini pawalawiti kumjini kwanja kulikomanga na Waisraeli, wawanikiti kulawa kunja kumji. Ilawiriti kayi ntambu yawatenditi mashaka gapititi wawalaga wantu wamu wa Israeli kunjira nkulu zyazigenda miji ya Beteli na Gibea, mpaka kushiwala. Wawalagiti Waisraeli malongu matatu. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Wantu wa Benjamini walonga, “Tuwakomanga handa shaka shipititi.” Kumbiti Waisraeli walonga, “twengapa tutugi su tuwaniki kutali na mji mpaka kunjira nkulu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Hangu lishonta likulu lya Israeli ligenditi kulipanga kayi aku Baali Tamari. Na wayawu yawaweriti wankulotera walawa kalongola pahala pawu uwega wagulawa mshenji wa mji gwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Mashonta wagangamala yawasyagulitwi kulawa makabila goseri ga Israeli wasoka panu kulongolu kulushi lwa Gibea. Nkondu za lishaka ali ziweriti nkulu. Kumbiti wantu wa Benjamini wavimaniti ndiri handa kulaguwa kwawu kuweriti pakwegera. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatanga wantu wa Benjamini kulongolu kwa Waisraeli, Waisraeli wawalaga wantu wa Benjamini malongu mawili na mhanu elufu na miya yimu. Woseri awa yawalagitwi waweriti mashonta yawaweziti kulikomera vimagi vikulu. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Na Wabenjamini wavimana handa wasinda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Waisraeli ntambu yawawakankiti Wabenjamini Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">wawuya ukaya handa wawatira wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini, iri kuwapanana lupenyu walii yawaweriti wawatula kulolera mji gwa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Walii yawatulitwi kulotera mji walawiti kalongola na kugukomanga mji gwa Gibea na kuwalaga kwa ligumba wantu woseri yawaweriti amu. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Waisraeli waweriti watenda majimiranu kutula langiru na wagwandira handa pawaliwona lyosi paliwera yankukwena kumpindi kulawa kumji su wagukomangi mji. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Shipindi ashi wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini waweriti wawalagiti kala Waisraeli wantu malongu matatu. Hangu waligambirana, “Tuwakomanga handa mashaka gapititi.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Kumbiti lilangaliru lii lya lyosi kugenda kumpindi palyanjiti kulawira mumji, wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini pawaloliti kumbeli kwawu, walikangasha kuwona handa mji gwawu goseri gwankutuma lyosi. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Waisraeli ndo wagalambuka, na wantu wa kabila lya Benjamini waweriti wankwinginika toziya waliwoniti wamufuwiru. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Hangu wagalambuka kulongolu kwa Waisraeli kugendera kushiwala, kumbiti nkondu iwapata, waliwona wapakatikati pa mashonta gawalikomangiti naga na walii yawaweriti wankugwandira mji, su walaguwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Waisraeli, wawazyengeta wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini, wawawingawinga kulawa Noha mpaka kwagulawa mshenji kwa Gibea pawawalaga wavuwa wao. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Lishaka ali wantu kumi na nani elufu wa likabila lya Benjamini, Wanjagira woseri wagangamala, wawalagiti. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Wantu yawasigaliti wa likabila lya Benjamini wagalambukiti, watugira kushiwala mpaka ku litalawu lya Rimoni. Wamonga elufu mhanu walagitwi kunjira nkulu pawaweriti wankutuga. Waisraeli wendereyiti kuwafata wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini mpaka mji gwa Gidomu wawalaga wantu elufu mbili. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Wantu woseri wa likabila lya benjamini wawalagitwi lishaka ali waweriti elufu ishilini na mhanu, mashonta yawaweriti wagangamala wa kutendera ligumba.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Kumbiti wapalu miya sita wa likabila lya Benjamini waweziti kutugira kushiwala mpaka kulitalawu lwa Rimoni, walikala aku kwa shaka sha miyezi msheshi. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Waisraeli wawagalambukila wantu wamonga wa likabila lya Benjamini wawalaga woseri, wapalu na wadala na wana na wankanyama. Na kila shintu na kila miji yawayiwoniti aku wavilunguziyiti.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Wabenjamini wankupananwa wadala wa kuheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />“Waisraeli waweriti walilapa aku Mizipa handa, kwahera ata yumu gwawu ulii mekamleki mhinga gwakuwi kahetwi na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Su, wagenda mpaka Beteli, walikala aku kulongolu kwa Mlungu mpaka pashimihi. Wabotanga na kulila kwa kuhinginika kuvuwa. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Pawalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, hashi shitwatira ashi shilawira ata tupunguluwa na likabila limu muisi ya Israeli?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Shirawu yakuwi wantu wimkiti mandawira, wanyawa shitalawanda, walaviya tambiku za kulunguziya na tambiku za ponga. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Shakapanu wana wa Israeli walonga, “Hashi, muwamu mwa makabila goseri ga Israeli kwana likabila lyoseri lilii lisoka ndiri mukuliwona kwatutenditi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu?” Waweriti walilapa kuwera muntu yoseri ulii yakasokiti ndiri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu aku Mizipa hakalagwi.<verse eid="JDG 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Kumbiti Waisraeli wawawonera lusungu walongu wawu wa likabila lya Benjamini, Walonga, “Leru likabila limu la Israeli lyagamira muwamu mwa makabila ga Israeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Vinu tutendi hashi su kuwapanana wadala awa wapalu wa likabila lya Benjamini yawasigaliti toziya tulilapa kulongolu kwa Mlungu handa hapeni tuwapanana wahinga wetu!”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />“Walonga hashi kwana likabila lyoseri lya Waisraeli lyeni ligenditi ndiri kulii Mizipa? Wayambula handa kwahera muntu yoseri kulawa Yabeshi Gileadi yakiziti mukuliwona aku.” <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Waisraeli pawawalangiti aku Mizipa kwahera mwenikaya yoseri gwa Yabeshi Gileadi yakiziti. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Hangu shipinga sha Israeli shijega wantu wakuwi elufu kumi na mbili yawaweriti wagangamala wa kulikomanga nkondu na kuwagambira. “Mgendi mkawalagi wanikaya wa Yabeshi Gileadi, wadala pamuhera na wana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Hamuwalagi wapalu woseri na wadala woseri wawawamana wapalu.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Su wawona muwamu mwa wenikaya wa Yabeshi Gileadi wadala miya msheshi walii waweriti ndiri wagonja na mpalu yoseri, wawajega kumalingu aku Shilu muisi ya Kanani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Shakapanu shipinga shoseri shituma walagilagi wa ponga wawagambiri wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini weni waweriti kulitalawu lya Rimoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Wapalu awa wa likabila lya Benjamini wawawuyira wayawu awa shaka shirashilii. Su wawapanana wadala walii yawaweriti wakomu aku Yabeshi Gileadi. Kumbiti wadala awa wawatosheya ndiri.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Waisraeli wawawonera lusungu wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu katenda likabila lilii sambira lyagamiri. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Shakapanu wazewi wa shipinga shoseri walonga, “vinu tutendi hashi su kuwapanana wadala walii wapalu awa yawasigaliti toziya wadala woseri wa likabila lya Benjamini walaguwitwi? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Mpaka wapalu yawasigaliti wa likabila lya Benjamini wapananwa wadala su wenderezi likabila na hangu natwagamiziya likabila Muisraeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Kumbiti tuweza ndiri kuwalaviya wahinga wetu waweri wadala wawu, toziya tulilapiti kala handa muntu yoseri yakamyugiziya mhinga gwakuwi kwa wapalu wa likabila lya Benjamini kapangiluwi.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />“Su walihola handa msambu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu yagutendeka kila shinja aku Shilu, mji yaguwera kushana kwa Beteli na kwagulawa mshenji mpaka kunjira yayilawa Beteli kugenda Shekemu na kweni ndo kusika kwa Lebanoni.”<verse eid="JDG 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Hangu wawagambira wapalu walii wa likabila lya Benjamini, “Mgendi mkagwandiri mumalambu ga mizabibu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Muweri masu. Wahinga wa Shilu pawalawa kunja kushiniga shaka sha msambu, mlawi mumizabibu na kila muntu kalitoleri mhinga yumu kaweri mdala gwakuwi. Shakapanu muwuyi muisi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Tati wawu ama wahasha wawu pawiza kushongera hatuwagambiri, twenga tuwaluwa muwawoneri lusungu wantu wa Benjamini na kuwaleka wawatoli wahinga awa, toziya tuwapanana ndiri wahinga yatuwalopoli munkondu na mwenga hapeni muweri na shidoda toziya muwapanana ndiri.”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Wapalu walii wa likabila vya Benjamini watenda hangu, kila yumu kalisyagulira mhinga muwamu mwa wahinga wawalawiti kunja kushiniga aku Shilu na kumtola kuwera mdala gwakuwi. Shakapanu wawuya mulienewu lyawu, wazinyawa mji yawu syayi na kulikala amu. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Shaka shiraashi Waisraeli wawuka, kila muntu kawuya muisi lya likabila lyakuyi na lukolu lwakuyi. <verse eid="JDG 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Mashaka aga kuweriti ndiri na mfalumi Muisraeli. Kila muntu katenda ntambu yakawoniti kuwera iherepa.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>